    ('00', '01', 'GenSec', 'FIN',
     'Series 9/10 - General Securities Sales Supervisor', 'The Series 9/10 Exam is designed to assess the competency of General Securities Sales Supervisors in the following fields:


?Sale of Corporate Securities
