     'Registered Apprentice Appraiser', 'A Registered Apprentice Appraiser is an individual who has satisfied the requirements for apprentice appraiser by the Appraiser Qualifications Board and who is subject to direct control and supervision by a qualified state-certified appraiser as a part of upgrading his or her classification to state-licensed or state-certified. The scope of practice for a registered apprentice appraiser is the appraisal of properties that the state-certified appraiser supervisor is permitted by his or her current credential and competent to appraise.',
