    ('06', '01', '385', '102',
     'Guide License', 'Required for any person who is engaged in the business of packing or guiding, or who for compensation, assists another person in taking, attempting to take or view any bird, mammal, fish, amphibian, or reptile. "Guide" also includes any person who, for profit, transports other persons, their equipment, or both to or from hunting or fishing areas.
Fees include a nonrefundable three percent (3%) application fee, not to exceed $7.50 per item. (California Code of Regulations, Title 14, Section 700.4). Items purchased from Online License Sales and Services and at license agents will include five percent (5%) nonrefundable license agent handling fee.
