Application: None
Examination: None
Examination Frequency:  N/A
Exam Locations: N/A
Experience Requirement: N/A
Average Time to Process Application: 15 working days.
Renewal Period: Annually, February 1 - January 31.
Special License Requirements: $1,000 Surety Bond.
Comments: Must possess a surety bond in the amount of not less than $1,000 to ensure faithful performance. Persons who have resided in California for 6 months or more are residents. Guide employers must also provide documentation showing each registered employee is covered by workers'' compensation insurance and that state and federal income tax is being withheld and reported to the taxing authorities.
Authority: Fish and Game Code, Sections 2535 - 2546.',
