    ('06', '01', '702', '146',
     'Home Improvement Salesperson Registration', 'Sales representatives who solicit, sell, negotiate or execute home improvement contracts for a licensed contractor outside the contractor''s normal place of business, regardless of the dollar amount of those contracts, must be registered with the Contractors State License Board.  The sales representative must hold a Home Improvement Salesperson (HIS) Registation for each contractor for whom he solicits work  
(Business and Professions Code, Sections 7152 - 7153.3).
Application Fee: $200
Experience Requirement: None
Exam Requirement: None.
Renewal Fee:  Timely $200; Delinquent $300
Renewal Period: Every two years.
Additional Requirement: Fingerprinting; must be at least 18 years of age.
Authority: Business and Professions Code, Section 7000 et seq.
