     'General Anesthesia Permit (dentist or physician)', 'California Licensed dentists or physicians.
Fees: Application: $524
On-site Inspection and Evaluation: $2000
Renewal: $325
Examination Frequency:  N/A
Exam Locations: N/A
Experience Requirement: Must have a minimum of one year residency program in anesthesia or an approved graduate program in oral and maxillofacial surgery or a fellowship in anesthesia approved by the American Dental Society of Anesthesiology.
Average Time to Process Application: 5 days.
Renewal Period: Biennially (every second year).
Special License Requirements: On-site inspection & evaluation required once every five years. Biennial renewal requires successful completion of 24 units of continuing education related to general anesthesia, including an advanced cardiac life support course.
Comments: N/A
Authority: Business and Professions Code, Sections 1646 - 1646.13.
