     'Title Marketing Representative', 'A Title Marketing Representative must hold a "certificate of registration."  A title marketing representative is a person employed by a title insurer, underwritten title company or controlled escrow company whose primary duty is to market, offer, solicit, negotiate or sell title insurance.

Qualifications:
