    ('06', '01', '80012', '124',
     'Administrator', 'A Certificate of Registration as an administrator is issued to a person who collects any charge or premium from, or who adjusts or settles claims on, residents of this State in connection with life or health insurance coverage or annuities or coverage described in California Insurance Code section 740.

Qualifications:
• Minimum Age: 18 years 
• Residency: California residency is not required 
