• Renewal: $188 each two-year license term
• Fingerprint fees: Fingerprint impressions are required for unlicensed applicants.  The fingerprint fee at the California Department of Insurance''s fingerprint vendor, Accurate Biometrics, is $59.  For more information, please review http://www.insurance.ca.gov/0200-industry/0200-prod-licensing/0100-applicant-info/0300-ca-fingerprint/index.cfm.

Other license information and requirements:
• Fingerprint Impressions: Are required for all unlicensed applicants 
• Examination: None
• Experience Requirement: None
• Average Time to Process Application: two to three weeks
• Renewal Period: Two-year license term that renews on the last day of the month the license was issued.
For more information on this license type use this URL: http://www.insurance.ca.gov/0200-industry/0050-renew-license/0200-requirements/administrator.cfm.
