     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     NULL, '20240522'),
    ('06', '01', '80023', '124',
     'Life-Limited to the Payment of Funeral and Burial Expenses', 'A Life-Limited to the Payment of Funeral and Burial Expenses license is limited by the terms of a written agreement with an insurer which has filed on that life-only agent''s behalf a notice of appointment with the commissioner to transact only specific life insurance policies or annuities having an initial face amount of twenty thousand dollars ($20,000) or less that are designated by the purchaser for the payment of funeral and burial expenses.

Qualifications:
