• Examination information: PSI Services, LLC, schedules the examinations CDI''s Life-Limited applicants. For scheduling examinations use PSI''s Examination Scheduling Service at PSI Online - One stop Solution for Test Takers (psiexams.com). Individuals may schedule their examinations with PSI either online or by telephone.
• Fingerprint Impressions: Fingerprint impressions are required for all unlicensed resident and most non-resident applicants
