     'Limited Sampler''s and Weigher''s License', 'Processing plant personnel who only collect samples of bulk raw milk for drug residue testing prior to processing.

Fees: Examination Application: $75; License Renewal: $75.
Examination Frequency:  Upon request.
Exam Locations: At place of business (a milk processing plant).
Experience Requirement: By written, and oral and practical examination applicant must show proficiency in sampling and weighing or measuring milk and cream.
Average Time to Process Application: 60 days.
Renewal Period: Biennially. Expires two years from date of issue. License renewal fees must be received within 90 days of the license expiration date for renewals to be issued. 
 
Special License Requirements: N/A
Comments: Study material is available at Branch Regional Offices. 
