Requirements:
Be 18 or older.
Undergo a criminal history background check through the DOJ and the FBI.
Possess an AA degree in Administration of Justice or one year of teaching or training experience in firearms or the equivalent thereof AND possess a police or security firearm instructor’s training certificate issued by the National Rifle Association or a firearm instructor’s training certificate issued by a federal, state, or local agency.
Application Fee - $350
DOJ Fingerprint Processing Fee - $32
FBI Fingerprint processing Fee - $17
Renewal Fee - $300
The initial license is valid for 2 years.  Each renewal cycle extends the registration for an additional 2 years.
