    ('08', '01', 'EMTL', 'L66',
     'Emergency Medical Technician', 'DESCRIPTION: EMTs are used to staff first response units, ambulances or may work in acute care settings such as hospitals and clinics. EMTs are allowed to perform medical acts as delegated by a physician referred to in Colorado as a "Medical Director".',
