    ('08', '01', 'WATEROPIOD', 'L41',
     'Certified Wastewater Operator (industrial or domestic)', 'DESCRIPTION: Utilization of a wide variety of chemicals, knowledgeable of biological waste systems, pumping maintenance, process controls, laboratory tests, lagoon maintenance, sampling, etc. Must be aware of all county, state, federal regulations unde',
