    ('09', '01', '115', '002',
     'Locksmith', 'Locksmith Registration
"Locksmithing" is the inspection, installation, recombination, rekeying services or repair of locks or locking devices. 
 
Prerequisites:
The following documentation must be attached and submitted with a completed application.  Do not submit the application until you are able to provide these record checks. 

    A Criminal History Record report from the State of Connecticut, State Police Bureau of Identification, 1111 Country Club Rd., Middletown, CT 06457. The form is available at https://portal.ct.gov/despp.

    A Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) Identification Record/Criminal Background Check.
    Information can be obtained at https://www.fbi.gov/services/cjis/identity-history-summary-checks',
