    ('09', '01', '134', '002',
     'Non-water Supply Driller', 'W-4 Limited Non-Water-Supply Driller

This registration permits the registrant to construct a non-water-supply well, including, but not limited to, the installation, repair and maintenance of pumps, pump motors, pump piping, valves, wiring, electric controls and tanks.  The registrant may only perform this work while in the direct and regular employment of a contractor registered for this work.

Requirements:
The requirements for this registration shall be one (1) year as a driller trainee or the equivalent experience and training.  The applicant must achieve a passing score on the written examination for this registration offered by the Department.',
