    15-hour classroom course in Legal Compliance.
    Two (2) 15-hour pre-license elective courses  OR 
        One (1) 30-hr pre-license Appraisal/pre-license elective course  OR
        20 real estate transactions in the previous 5 years. A transaction is defined as a legal transfer of real estate property or execution of a lease agreement
