    ('12', '01', '261', 'DOI',
     'Property and Casualty (Customer Representative)', '626.015 & 626.7351: A salaried employee of the general lines (property and casualty) agent or agency that may transact automobile, water craft, home, motorcycle, and pet insurance under the supervision of a licensed and appointed general lines agent.',
