    ('12', '01', '249', 'DOI',
     'Health and Life Insurance - Health Resident', '624.603, 626.015, 626.829, & 626.8305: A "HEALTH AGENT” is defined as any person appointed as an agent by an insurer to solicit applications for or to negotiate and effectuate contract of health insurance, as such insurance and includes an individual representing a health maintenance organization.  "HEALTH INSURANCE" is defined as health insurance against loss through sickness or accidental bodily injury.',
