    ('12', '01', '268', 'DOI',
     'Property and Casualty (Personal Lines Resident)', '262.015 & 626.732: A "PERSONAL LINES AGENT" is defined as a general lines agent who is limited to transacting business related to property and casualty insurance sold to individuals and families for noncommercial purposes.',
     '0', '1', '0', '1', '0',
