     'https://myfloridacfo.com/division/agents/Licensure/General/default.htm', '20200225'),
    ('12', '01', '276', 'DOI',
     'Reinsurance Intermediary Brokers Resident', 'Florida Statutes 626.7492: defines a "REINSURANCE INTERMEDIARY BROKER" (RIB) as a person other than an officer or employee of the ceding insurer, who solicits, negotiates, or places reinsurance cessions or retro cessions on behalf of a ceding insurer without the authority or power to bind reinsurance on behalf of the ceding insurer.',
