    ('12', '01', '280', 'DOI',
     'Service Representative Resident', 'Florida Statutes 626.015: defines a "SERVICE REPRESENTATIVE" as individuals employed by insurers or managing general agents, for the purpose of assisting general lines agent in negotiating and effecting insurance contracts when accompanied by a licensed general lines agent. No such person shall be licensed as a general lines agent in this state. This does not apply to life insurance.',
