    ('12', '01', '349', 'DOE',
     'Teaching Computer Science (grades K-12)', 'Specialization Requirements for Certification in Computer Science (Grades K-12) – Academic Class. (1) Plan One. A bachelor’s or higher degree with an undergraduate or graduate major in computer science or computer science education, or (2) Plan Two. A bachelor’s or higher degree with thirty (30) semester hours in computer science or computer science education to include credit in the areas specified below: (a) Computer applications; and, (b) Computer programming.',
