     'http://www.myfloridalicense.com/DBPR/real-estate-appraisal-board/', '20200225'),
    ('12', '01', '74', 'BP1',
     'Hair Braider', 'F.S. 477. A “hair braider” means a person who is licensed to engage in the practice of weaving or interweaving natural human hair for compensation without cutting, coloring, permanent waving, relaxing, removing, or chemical treatment and does not include the use of hair extensions or wefts.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', 'I', '0',
     'http://www.myfloridalicense.com/DBPR/cosmetology/', '20200225'),
    ('12', '01', '75', 'BP1',
     'Hair Wrapper', 'F.S. 477. A “hair wrapper” means a person who is licensed to engage in the practice of wrapping manufactured materials around a strand or strands of human hair, for compensation, without cutting, coloring, permanent waving, relaxing, removing, weaving, chemically treating, braiding, using hair extensions, or performing any other service defined as cosmetology.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '0',
