     'http://www.myfloridalicense.com/DBPR/cosmetology/', '20200225'),
    ('12', '01', '76', 'BP1',
     'Home Inspector', 'Florida Statute 468, Part XV. A “Home Inspector” means any person who provides or offers to provide home inspection services for a fee or other compensation.',
