    ('12', '01', '91', 'BP1',
     'Physician', 'F.S. 548.002“Physician” means a person who is approved by the commission, who has a license to practice medicine issued pursuant to chapter 458 or chapter 459, and whose license to practice medicine is unencumbered and in good standing.',
