    ('12', '01', '95', 'BP1',
     'Promoter', 'F.S. 548.002 “Promoter” means a person or entity, including an officer, director, trustee, partner, or owner of a corporate promoter or promoter partnership, who produces, arranges, or stages a match involving a professional.',
