    ('13', '01', '013', '036',
     'Advanced Practice - CNS', 'A clinical nurse specialist (CNS) is an advanced practice registered nurse (APRN) who specializes in a specific nursing area. CNSs are responsible for improving patient care and outcomes, and meeting the needs of patients, clinicians, and organizations.',
