    ('13', '01', '015', '036',
     'Advanced Practice - CRNA', 'A Certified Registered Nurse Anesthetist (CRNA) is a registered nurse who has specialized training in anesthesia. They are advanced practice nurses who play a vital role in medical procedures by providing anesthesia and related care before, during, and after.',
