    ('13', '01', '031', '034',
     'Professional Counselor', 'Counselors must be certified in Georgia.

1. Master''s degree from an accredited program and four years of approved experience or
2. Specialist degree in counseling and two years of approved experience or
3. Doctorate degree and one year of approved experience
4. Pass a written exam',
