     'https://sos.ga.gov/board-professional-counselors-social-workers-and-marriage-family-therapists', '20240910'),
    ('13', '01', '033', '034',
     'Master Social Worker', 'Applicant requirements:
 master''s degree in social work from an accredited program
three years of approved experience in clinical social work
pass a written exam
 
A doctorate degree combined with a master''s degree and internship may satisfy up to one year of the experience requirements.
 
