    ('13', '01', '037', '043',
     'Auricular Detoxification Technician', 'An auricular detoxification specialist monitors detoxification for clients and conducts assessments. They facilitate group and individual sessions with residential clients, developing and implementing discharge plans for successful transitions. Applying auricular acupuncture for detoxification is a key part of their job.',
