    ('15', '01', '0000000078', '049',
     'Behavior Analyst', 'DESCRIPTION OF OCCUPATION:
A Behavior Analyst counsels and advises individuals with alcohol, tobacco, drug, or other behavior problems, such as gambling and eating disorders. May counsel individuals, families, or groups or engage in prevention programs.

