    ('16', '01', '1037', '004',
     'Athletic Ringside Physician', 'Ringside physicians for amateur and professional boxing, wrestling, and martial arts matches in Idaho must be licensed by The Idaho Athletic Commission. Applicants must: 1) Be licensed by the Idaho Board of Medicine; 2) Be certified to perform cardiopulmonary resuscitation. Term: Licenses are renewed annually.',
