    ('16', '01', '2064', '116',
     'Felony Probation & Parole Officers', 'Parole officers must be certified by the Peace Officers Standards and Training program (POST ) within one year after they are hired. To be accepted into the POST program or hired as a peace officer, applicants must: 1.)',
     '0', '9', '1', '9', '9',
