    ('17', '01', '263', '140',
     'PEST CONTROL TECHNICIAN (GENERAL USE), STRUCTURAL', 'An individual who performs pest control services, including the use of general use pesticides in and around structures (as opposed to applications of pesticides in agriculture).',
     '1', '1', '0', '9', '0',
