    ('17', '01', '341', '296',
     'RESTRICTED SHORTHAND REPORTER', 'An individual who is licensed, upon the written request of the Director of the Administrative Offices of the Illinois Courts, and appointed, in counties of less than 100,000 people, to engage in reporting only those court proceedings to which he/she may be assigned by the chief judge of his/her circuit.',
