     'https://www.asha.org/advocacy/state/info/la/louisiana-support-personnel-requirements/#:~:text=In%20order%20to%20be%20licensed,accredited%20educational%20institution%20or%20its', '20240906'),
    ('22', '01', '0413021', '021',
     'Insurance Producer', '• Must be at least 18 years of age.
