    ('22', '01', '0433011', '056',
     'Respossession Agent', '• Must be 18 years of age or older and a citizen of the United States or a resident alien holding proper documentation to work in the United States.
• Must be of good character and fitness.
• Must not have been convicted of a felony in the previous 10 years, regardless that the conviction was expunged, set aside, or received a first offense pardon.
• Must have two years experience as a repossession agent or apprentice within the previous three years.
• Must have received a designation as a certified recovery specialist from a recognized national certification program.',
