    ('22', '01', '132020', '028',
     'Real Estate Appraiser', 'Trainee: Must work under the supervision of a licensed Louisiana certified appraiser.
Certified Residential: Must pass the residential appraiser licensing examination administered by the national testing service under contract with the Board. Payment of the $80 registration fee for the Appraisal Federal Registry.
Certified General: Must pass the general appraiser licensing examination administered by the national testing service under contract with the Board. Payment of the $80 registration fee for the Appraisal Federal Registry.',
     '0', '2', '1', '1', '2',
