    ('22', '01', '1419022', '029',
     'Real Estate Salesperson', '•  Pass the real estate licensing examination administered by the national testing service currently under contract with the commission.
•  Comply with application procedures as required by the commission’s licensing and testing division.',
     '0', '2', '1', '1', '0',
