     '2', '0', '0', '9', '0',
     'https://www.plumberstraininginstitute.com/louisiana/faq/', '20240906'),
    ('22', '01', '1499062', '058',
     'Medical (gas Vacuum System Verifier)', '• Must complete 32 hours of Medical Gas Installation training that meets the criteria prescribed by the Board and NFPA99C Gas and Vacuum Systems.
• Must pay appropriate fees.',
