     'https://www.civilservice.louisiana.gov/files/general_circulars/2019/GC2019-024.pdf', '20240906'),
    ('22', '01', '291161', '040',
     'Midwives (Licensed)', 'The Midwifery Practice Act defines the practice of midwifery.
· Must pass the appropriate examinations.
· Must complete an approved midwifery program',
