     '2', '4', '0', '9', '0',
     'https://www.midwifeschooling.com/louisiana/', '20240906'),
    ('22', '01', '291171', '041',
     'Nurse Practitioner', 'Possess a current/valid, unrestricted Louisiana Registered Nurse (RN) license. Possess a minimum of a graduate degree or post graduate award with a concentration in the respective APRN role. Completion of the APRN educational program must have occurred within the preceding 2 years.',
