     'https://www.lbespa.org/index.cfm/rules-and-regulations', '20240906'),
    ('22', '01', '291210', '040',
     'Physician or Medical Doctor', 'Graduation from an approved medical school or equivalent.
• One year of internship (American graduates), three years of residency (International graduates).
• Must pass U.S.M.L.E. examination.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '9',
