     'https://sfm.dps.louisiana.gov/doc/PPE_Locksmith.pdf', '20240906'),
    ('22', '01', '499099', '017',
     'Weight and Measures Service Technicians and Weighmasters', 'All service technicians and weighmasters but pass a basic knowledge exam available through the Louisiana Department of Agriculture and Forestry before they can become licensed.',
