    ('23', '01', '001001', '001',
     'Adult and Community Education Assistant Director', 'Community education assistant directors deliver educational programming in the community setting with a variety of teaching methods using an established curriculum.',
     '1', '2', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '001002', '001',
     'Adult and Community Education Director', 'Community education directors function as the head of programs designed to meet the educational needs of diverse populations. A director''s role involves planning and assessment, and may involve hiring staff and managing curricula.',
     '1', '2', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001003', '001',
     'Curriculum Coordinator/Instructional Supervisor', 'Curriculum coordinators are responsible for assisting in the development, revision, implementation, and evaluation of school curriculum. The coordinator is also responsible for developing and providing opportunities for teacher training and in-service activities related to the school''s curriculum and initiatives.',
     '1', '2', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001006', '001',
     'Educational Tech (Levels I, II and III)', 'Educational technicians provide supportive educational services for students in K-12 schools and often provide instruction for children with disabilities..',
     '1', '2', '9', '9', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001009', '001',
     'Library Media Specialist', 'A library media specialist is a trained professional who works in schools to help students and staff members find materials and learn to do research.',
     '2', '2', '9', '0', '0',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001010', '001',
     'Literacy Specialist', 'Literacy specialists are responsible for guiding, leading and assessing how to help students improve their reading skills to reach their educational goals.',
     '2', '2', '9', '9', '9',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001011', '001',
     'Building Administrator', 'Building administrators are responsible for keeping the building and grounds in good working order as to maintain a safe, clean, and healthy environment for students and staff.',
     '1', '2', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001012', '001',
     'Building Administrator, Assistant', 'Assistant building administrators are responsible for helping keep the building and grounds in good working order as to maintain a safe, clean, and healthy environment for students and staff.',
     '0', '2', '0', '0', '2',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001013', '001',
     'Principal, Teaching', 'Principals lead teachers and staff, set goals and ensure students meet their learning objectives. Overseeing a school''s day-to-day operations may inlcude handling disciplinary matters, managing a budget and hiring teachers and other personnel.',
     '2', '2', '1', '9', '2',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001016', '001',
     'School Counselor', 'School counselors listen to students'' concerns about academic, emotional, or social issues. They help students process their problems and establish goals and plans of action.',
     '2', '2', '9', '0', '0',
     '9', '9', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001017', '001',
     'School Psychologist', 'School psychologists help children and students of all educational levels manage social, emotional, behavioral, and learning problems.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001019', '001',
     'Special Education, Administrator of', 'Special education administrators oversee all special education staff and programs serving students with special needs.',
     '1', '2', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001020', '001',
     'Special Education, Assistant Administrator of', 'Special education administrative assistants often maintain a calendar, schedule meetings, perform internal and external communication, assist school employees, screen telephones, and manage office mail.',
     '1', '9', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001022', '001',
     'Superintendent', 'Superintendents implement the visions of their school boards vision by making day-to-day decisions about educational programs, spending, staff, and facilities.',
     '1', '2', '9', '0', '2',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001023', '001',
     'Superintendent, Assistant', 'Assistant superintendents aid the superintendent in the daily operation of the district as well as the planning, implementing, directing and maintaining of district programs by providing a wide variety of complex and confidential administrative and secretarial support.',
     '0', '2', '0', '0', '2',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001024', '001',
     'Teacher (various primary, secondary and adult)', 'Teachers are responsible for preparing lesson plans and educating students at all levels. Their duties include assigning homework, grading tests, and documenting progress.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001043', '001',
     'Athletic Director', 'Athletic directors generally oversee all aspects of an athletic program, including hiring coaches, scheduling, budget preparation, promotion, compliance, and facility management.',
     '0', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001044', '001',
     'School Nurse (K-12)', 'School nurses are specialist nursing professionals that are responsible for caring to students with illnesses and injuries and advancing the health of students and staff within the school environment.',
     '1', '2', '0', '0', '2',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '001045', '001',
     'Cooperative Education Coordinator (9-12)', 'Cooperative education coordinators manage the cooperative education program for all eligible students in grades 9 through 12, giving qualifying students the opportunity to participate in paid and unpaid apprenticeships or employment programs in their career interests for academic credit.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '002001', '002',
     'Blaster, Explosives', 'Blaster or explosives workers place and detonate explosives to demolish structures or to loosen, remove, or displace earth, rock, or other materials. They may perform specialized handling, storage, and accounting procedures.',
     '1', '0', '0', '0', '0',
