     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008048', '008',
     'Chiropractor', 'Chiropractors are healthcare professionals who use techniques to alleviate problems in their patients'' neuromusculoskeletal systems. They perform spinal adjustments, massage clients, and use ultrasounds to reduce the pain or tension that their patients experience.',
