     '2', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008056', '008',
     'Cosmetologist, Temporary Permit', 'Cosmetologists serve customers by providing various beauty services, such as hair styling, manicures, pedicures, scalp and facial treatments, and make-up application. Temporary licenses are awarded to those who have completed the education requirements or can prove they are licensed in another state.',
