     '0', '0', '9', 'D', '0',
     '4', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008057', '008',
     'Counselor, Clinical', 'Clinical counselors work with individuals, groups and communities to improve mental health. They encourage clients to discuss emotions and experiences, and examine issues including substance abuse, aging, bullying, anger management, career, depression, relationships, LGBTQ issues, self-image, stress and more.',
     '1', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '0', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008058', '008',
     'Counselor, Clinical (Conditional)', 'Clinical counselors work with individuals, groups and communities to improve mental health. They encourage clients to discuss emotions and experiences. They examine issues including substance abuse, aging, bullying, anger management, career, depression, relationships, LGBTQ issues, self-image, stress and more. This conditional version is earned by completing supplemental graduate level coursework to fulfill the education requirement.',
     '1', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '0', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008059', '008',
     'Counselor, Marriage & Family', 'Marriage and family counselors provide counseling to couples and families and assess and treat intrapersonal and interpersonal problems and other dysfunctional behaviors to assist in the overall development and adjustment of their clients.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008060', '008',
     'Counselor, Marriage & Family (Conditional)', 'Marriage and family counselors provide counseling to assess and treat intrapersonal and interpersonal problems and other dysfunctional behaviors and assist in the overall development and adjustment of those served. This temporary conditional license can be awarded to someone who has met all license requirements except completion of the exam. The applicant must complete and pass the exam within 6 months.',
     '0', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008061', '008',
     'Counselor, Pastoral', 'Pastoral counselors are trained mental health professionals that provide both psychological therapy and spiritual guidance to individuals, couples, families, and groups in various settings. Due to the nature of their counseling work, pastoral counselors must be highly trained in both psychology and theology.',
     '1', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008062', '008',
     'Counselor, Pastoral (Conditional)', 'Pastoral counselors are trained mental health professionals that provide both psychological therapy and spiritual guidance to individuals, couples, families, and groups in various settings. Due to the nature of their counseling work, pastoral counselors must be highly trained in both psychology and theology. Conditional licenses are awarded to applicants so they can fulfill the supervised experience requirements. After they have achieved 3000 hours of supervised experience they may apply for regular licenses and practice independently.',
     '1', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008063', '008',
     'Counselor, Professional', 'Professional counselors work as mental health service providers, whose main role is to assess people for disorders and provide courses of treatment. They also help children, teenagers, adults and the elderly deal with cognitive-behavioral, interpersonal and mental health issues.',
     '1', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008064', '008',
     'Counselor, Professional (Conditional)', 'Professional counselors work as mental health service providers, whose main role is to assess people for disorders and provide courses of treatment. They also help children, teenagers, adults and the elderly deal with cognitive-behavioral, interpersonal and mental health issues. Conditional licenses are awarded to applicants so they can fulfill the supervised experience requirements. After they have achieved 2,000 hours of supervised experience, they may apply for regular licenses and practice independently.',
     '1', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008065', '008',
     'Counselor, Registered', 'Only available to counselors who registered prior to August 1st, 2008. Registration does not imply or certify in any way that the registered counselors have met any standards or criteria of education or training. A registered counselor may not diagnose or treat mental health disorders.',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008066', '008',
     'Credit Reporting Agency (Credit Bureau) Operator', 'Any credit reporting agency (credit bureau) used by creditors in Maine must be registered. Registration consists of the completion of an application form, the payment of a $100.00 fee, and submission of samples of model language or forms for disclosure to consumers at time of application, and model denial forms (if utilized).',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008067', '008',
     'Dietetic Technician', 'Dietetic technicians assess patients'' and clients'' nutritional and health needs. They counsel patients on nutrition issues and healthy eating habits and develop meal and nutrition plans, taking both clients'' preferences and budgets into account. Dietetic techs typically work under dietitians.',
     '1', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008068', '008',
     'Dietitian', 'Dietitians assess patients'' and clients'' nutritional and health needs. They counsel patients on nutrition issues and healthy eating habits and develop meal and nutrition plans, taking both clients'' preferences and budgets into account. Dietitians are typically in charge of dietetic techs.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '008069', '008',
     'Dietetic Technician, Temporary', 'Dietetic technicians assess patients'' and clients'' nutritional and health needs. They counsel patients on nutrition issues and healthy eating habits and develop meal and nutrition plans, taking both clients'' preferences and budgets into account. Dietetic techs typically work under dieticians. A temporary license is awarded before completion of the exam.',
