     'Dietitian, Temporary', 'Dietitians assess patients'' and clients'' nutritional and health needs. They counsel patients on nutrition issues and healthy eating habits and develop meal and nutrition plans, taking both clients'' preferences and budgets into account. Dietitians are typically in charge of dietetic techs. A temporary license is awarded before completion of the exam.',
