     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008152', '008',
     'Plumber, Master', 'Master plumbers install, repair, and maintain pipes, valves, fittings, drainage systems, and fixtures in commercial and residential structures.',
     '1', '1', '0', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008153', '008',
     'Plumber, Trainee', 'Trainee plumbers work with masters to learn to install, repair, and maintain pipes, valves, fittings, drainage systems, and fixtures in commercial and residential structures.',
     '4', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008154', '008',
     'Podiatrist', 'Podiatrists perform foot and ankle surgeries, prescribe orthotics, and apply therapeutic treatments for issues like arthritis, fractures, and feet corn and calluses.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008159', '008',
     'Propane and Natural Gas Technician', 'Propane and natural gas technicians may install, repair or service propane or natural gas equipment.',
     '2', '1', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008160', '008',
     'Psychologist (including Conditional and Temporary)', 'Psychologists often gather information and evaluate behavior through controlled laboratory experiments, psychoanalysis, or psychotherapy. They also may administer personality, performance, aptitude, or intelligence tests.',
     '4', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008161', '008',
     'Psychologist Examiner (including Conditional and Temporary)', 'Psychological examiners may provide intervention, such as consultation, behavior management or social skills training under the supervision of a licensed psychologist.',
     '4', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008162', '008',
     'Radiologic Technologist, Temporary', 'Radiologic technologists use diagnostic imaging equipment to help physicians identify illnesses and injuries. They may use x-ray equipment, computed tomography, magnetic resonance imaging, or mammography to perform X-rays, CT scans, MRIs, or mammograms.',
     '4', '1', '0', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008163', '008',
     'Radiologic Technologist-Nuclear Medicine', 'Nuclear medicine technologists prepare and administer small amounts of radioactive substances called radiopharmaceuticals, as well as other medications, to patients for diagnosis and treatments.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008167', '008',
     'Real Estate Associate Broker', 'Real estate brokers help home buyers and sellers with property transactions and advise on issues such as price, market outlook, mortgages and other information. Applicants for an associate broker license must have been licensed as a real estate sales agent affiliated with a real estate brokerage agency for 2 years within the 5 years immediately preceding the date of their applications.',
     '0', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008170', '008',
     'Real Estate Broker/Designated Broker', 'Real estate brokers help home buyers and sellers with property transactions and advise on issues such as price, market outlook, mortgages and other information. Applicants must have been licensed as associate brokers affiliated with a real estate brokerage agency for 2 years within the 5 years immediately preceding the date of their applications.',
     '0', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008171', '008',
     'Real Estate Brokerage Agency', 'Real estate brokerage agency means any person or entity licensed by the Department of Professional and Financial Regulation to engage in real estate brokerage services through its designated broker, associates or employees.',
     '1', '1', '0', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008172', '008',
     'Real Estate Sales Agent', 'Real estate sales agents rent or sell property for clients. They perform duties such as studying property listings, interviewing prospective clients, accompanying clients to the property site, discussing conditions of sale, and drawing up real estate contracts.',
     '2', '1', '0', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008173', '008',
     'Respiratory Care Technician', 'Respiratory care technicians provide therapy, management, rehabilitation, diagnostic evaluation and care, administered on the order of a physician or surgeon, to patients with deficiencies and abnormalities affecting the cardiopulmonary system and associated aspects of other bodily systems.',
     '1', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008174', '008',
     'Respiratory Care Therapist', 'Respiratory care therapists provide therapy, management, rehabilitation, diagnostic evaluation and care, administered on the order of a physician or surgeon, to patients with deficiencies and abnormalities affecting the cardiopulmonary system and associated aspects of other bodily systems.',
     '1', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008175', '008',
     'Respiratory Care Technician, Temporary', 'Respiratory care technicians provide therapy, management, rehabilitation, diagnostic evaluation and care, administered on the order of a physician or surgeon, to patients with deficiencies and abnormalities affecting the cardiopulmonary system and associated aspects of other bodily systems. A temporary license can be earned without taking an exam.',
     '4', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008176', '008',
     'Respiratory Care Associate', 'Respiratory care associates provide therapy, management, rehabilitation, diagnostic evaluation and care, administered on the order of a physician or surgeon, to patients with deficiencies and abnormalities affecting the cardiopulmonary system and associated aspects of other bodily systems. An associates license can be earned if one has NBRC credentials or is licensed in another state.',
     '0', '2', '0', '1', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008179', '008',
     'Social Worker, Licensed', 'Social workers help individuals, families and communities handle everyday life problems. They often assist clients who have issues caused by neglect, abuse, domestic violence, mental health and parental substance abuse.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008180', '008',
     'Social Worker, Licensed-Conditional', 'Social workers help individuals, families and communities handle everyday life problems. They often assist clients who have issues caused by neglect, abuse, domestic violence, mental health and parental substance abuse. An exam is not required for a conditional license.',
     '0', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008181', '008',
     'Social Worker, Licensed Master', 'Social workers help individuals, families and communities handle everyday life problems. They often assist clients who have issues caused by neglect, abuse, domestic violence, mental health and parental substance abuse.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008182', '008',
     'Social Worker, Licensed Master-Conditional Clinical', 'Clinical social workers will observe client behavior, assess needs and create treatment strategies. They also diagnose psychological, behavioral and emotional disorders.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008183', '008',
     'Social Worker, Licensed Clinical', 'Clinical social workers will observe client behavior, assess needs and create treatment strategies. They also diagnose psychological, behavioral and emotional disorders.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008186', '008',
     'Soil Scientist', 'Soil scientists evaluate and interpret soils and soil-related data for the purpose of understanding soil resources as they contribute to agricultural production. Soil affects environmental quality and is managed for protection of human health and the environment.',
     '2', '2', '0', '0', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008188', '008',
     'Solid Fuel Burner Technician, Apprentice', 'Solid fuel burner technician apprentices learn to adjust and install various temperature controls and devices using their knowledge of electrical circuits and troubleshooting.',
     '4', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008189', '008',
     'Solid Fuel Burner Technician, Master', 'Master solid fuel burner technicians adjust and install various temperature controls and devices using their knowledge of electrical circuits and troubleshooting.',
     '1', '9', '0', '0', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008190', '008',
     'Speech-Language Pathologist or Audiologist, Temporary', 'Speech-language pathologists work to prevent, assess, diagnose, and treat speech, language, social communication, cognitive-communication, and swallowing disorders in children and adults. Experience is not required for a temporary license.',
     '4', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008192', '008',
     'Speech-Language Pathologist', 'Speech-language pathologists work to prevent, assess, diagnose, and treat speech, language, social communication, cognitive-communication, and swallowing disorders in children and adults.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008194', '008',
     'Alcohol & Drug Certified Clinical Supervisor', 'CADC counselors help people by guiding them to understanding the underlying causes of their addiction and assisting them in seeking treatment. Counseling can happen in small-group or one-on-one sessions. Some counselors specialize, while others work with a general audience.',
     '0', '1', '1', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008195', '008',
     'Tramway Inspector', 'Tramway inspectors perform inspections required on tramways in the State of Maine.',
     '1', '0', '0', '0', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008196', '008',
     'Transient Sales, Company of', '"Transient seller of consumer merchandise" or "transient seller" means any person who engages in the business of selling merchandise to consumers by means of personal contact or telephone contact, whether or not the seller is present in the state at the time of the contact or the time of sale, and who does not have, for the purposes of carrying on such business, any permanent place of business within this state.',
     '0', '0', '0', '1', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008197', '008',
     'Transient Vendor Employee', '"Transient seller of consumer merchandise" or "transient seller" means any person who engages in the business of selling merchandise to consumers by means of personal contact or telephone contact, whether or not the seller is present in the state at the time of the contact or the time of sale, and who does not have, for the purposes of carrying on such business, any permanent place of business within this state.',
     '1', '9', '0', '9', '9',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008199', '008',
     'Veterinarian', 'Veterinarians care for the health of animals and work to protect public health. They diagnose, treat, and research medical conditions and diseases of pets, livestock, and other animals.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008200', '008',
     'Veterinarian Technician', 'Vet techs use medical knowledge and clinical skills to provide routine and emergency nursing care to animals under the direction of a veterinarian.',
     '2', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008201', '005',
     'Weighmaster, Public', 'Weighmasters use scales and weighing equipment to weigh materials, products, or other items, such as trucks.',
     '1', '0', '0', '9', '9',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008202', '008',
     'Wire Rope Inspector', 'Wire rope inspectors perform inspections required for each tramway equipped with wire rope in the State of Maine.',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008208', '008',
     'Audiologist', 'Audiologists examine patients who have hearing, balance, or related ear problems, assess the results of the examination, diagnose problems, and administer treatment to meet patients'' goals.',
     '1', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008209', '008',
     'Nail Technician, Instructor', 'Nail technician instructors teach others how to provide individualized nail services and treatments to clients, including manicures and pedicures.',
     '1', '1', '0', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', 'D', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008210', '008',
     'Chiropractic Acupuncture', 'Chiropractic acupuncturists use both chiropractic care and acupuncture to treat their clients.',
     '0', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008212', '008',
     'Speech-Language Pathology Assistant', 'Speech-language pathologist assistants meet minimum qualifications that the board may establish for Speech-Language Pathology Assistants, which are less than those qualifications established for licensure, but which must include an Associate''s Degree or its equivalent as determined by the board, in the field of Communication Disorders.',
     '0', '2', '0', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008213', '008',
     'Herbal Formulations, Custom-made Chinese', 'Custom-Made Chinese Herbal Certification means the practice of formulation and dispensing of custom-made Chinese herbal formulations.',
     '1', '2', '0', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008214', '008',
     'Naturopathic Doctor', 'Naturopathic doctors are licensed to practice naturopathic medicine.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008215', '008',
     'Naturopathic Acupuncture', 'Naturopathic acupuncturists insert acupuncture needles into strategic points on the skin to treat human disease and impairment and to relieve pain.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008217', '008',
     'Occupational Therapist, Temporary', 'Temporary occupational therapy licenses can be awarded before an applicant has completed the examination required for normal licensure.',
     '4', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008218', '008',
     'Occupational Therapist Assistant, Temporary', '"Certified Occupational Therapy Assistant" means an individual who has passed the certification examination of the National Board for Certification in Occupational Therapy as an occupational therapy assistant or who was certified as an Occupational Therapy Assistant prior to June 1977 and who is licensed to practice Occupational Therapy under the supervision of an Occupational Therapist.',
     '4', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008219', '008',
     'Alcohol & Drug Counselor (Certified)', 'CADC workers provide individual or group alcohol and drug counseling services. They may not engage in independent or private practice.',
     '1', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '0', '0', '9', 'A', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008220', '008',
     'Pharmacy Technicians', 'Pharmacy technician or student pharmacist means a person employed by a pharmacy who works in a supportive role under the direct supervision of a licensed pharmacist.',
     '1', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008221', '008',
     'Pharmacist, Authorization of Administration of Drugs and Immunizations', 'A Maine licensed pharmacist may apply for authorization to administer drugs and immunizations.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008222', '008',
     'Pharmacist', 'Pharmacist means an individual licensed by this state to engage in the practice of pharmacy.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '008224', '008',
     'Pharmacy Intern, Educated in U.S. or Canada', 'Pharmacy intern means a person employed by a pharmacy who works in a supportive role under the direct supervision of a licensed pharmacist.',
     '4', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008225', '008',
     'Pharmacy Intern, Educated in Foreign Country other than Canada', 'Pharmacy intern means a person employed by a pharmacy who works in a supportive role to, and under the direct supervision of, a licensed pharmacist.',
     '4', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008226', '008',
     'Pharmacy, Retail Drug Outlet', 'Pharmacy means a retail drug outlet registered with the board.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008227', '008',
     'Pharmacy, Mail Order Prescription', 'A mail order prescription pharmacy is an entity that dispenses prescription medications by mail or carrier from a facility not located in the state of Maine to a patient who resides in Maine.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008228', '008',
     'Pharma, Manufacturer of Prescription Drugs', 'Pharma manufacturer means an organization engaged in the manufacturing of prescription drugs.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '1', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008229', '008',
     'Pharma, Wholesaler of Prescription Drugs', 'Wholesaler means a person who buys prescription drugs for resale and distribution to persons other than consumers.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '1', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008230', '008',
     'Optometrist', 'Optometrists perform vision tests and analyze results. They diagnose sight problems, such as nearsightedness or farsightedness, and eye diseases, such as glaucoma. Finally, they prescribe eyeglasses, contact lenses, other visual aids and medications.',
     '2', '2', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008300', '008',
     'Forester, Intern', 'Intern forester means a person authorized by the Department of Professional and Financial Regulation under the sponsorship of a licensed forester to perform professional services requiring the application of forestry principles and techniques, including investigations, consultations, development of forest management plans, supervision of forest management, forest utilization, forest economics or other forestry activities carried out in connection with public or private lands.',
     '4', '9', '1', '9', '9',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008301', '008',
     'Forester, Supervisor or Unlicensed', 'A Forester may register with the board to supervise and direct an unlicensed person in the practice of forestry.',
     '0', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '008302', '008',
     'Pharmacist, Collaborative Drug Therapy Mgmt.', 'A Maine licensed pharmacist may apply for collaborative drug therapy management. The license does not require a license fee.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008303', '008',
     'Interior Designer, Certified', 'Certified interior designers are certified to use the title "certified interior designer" after having met the requirements for certification, and design the interior of structures in order to achieve a visually pleasing look.',
     '2', '2', '0', '9', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008304', '008',
     'Interpreters and Translators', 'Contact the licensing agency for details.',
     '0', '0', '0', '1', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008305', '008',
     'Chiropractic Acupuncturist', 'Chiropractor Acupuncture means the insertion of acupuncture needles through the skin at strategic points. It is a chiropractic methodology used for the correction of the soft tissue components contributing to subluxation and the accompanying physiological or mechanical abnormalities. Except as provided in section 502, chiropractic acupuncture may only be practiced by a licensee who has received a chiropractic acupuncture certification from the board.',
     '0', '2', '0', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008306', '008',
     'Aesthetician Instructor', 'An aesthetician instructor means a person who may instruct in any of the branches of aesthetics, barbering, limited barbering, cosmetology or nail technology contingent on the possession of a valid license to practice and is authorized to instruct in each respective practice issued under this chapter. Physicians may instruct without holding a license to practice in a branch of aesthetics, barbering, limited barbering, cosmetology or nail technology.',
     '2', '2', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', 'D', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008307', '008',
     'Lift Mechanic', 'A lift mechanic is a person who services, repairs, alters or installs lifts in the State of Maine.',
     '0', '9', '0', '9', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008308', '008',
     'Elevator Contractor', 'Any person, firm, partnership, association, corporation or company engaged in the installation, sale, service, maintenance or inspection of elevators in this state shall register with the board annually. The registration must include the names and addresses of all licensed private inspectors, licensed mechanics and all helpers employed by the elevator contractor.',
     '0', '9', '0', '9', '9',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008309', '008',
     'Manufactured Housing Installer', '"Installer" means any person licensed by the Department of Professional and Financial Regulation engaged for compensation in the installation and service of the installation of manufactured housing.',
     '0', '1', '0', '1', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008310', '008',
     'Manufactured Housing Dealer', '"Dealer" means a person licensed by the Department of Professional and Financial Regulation engaged in the retail selling or offering for sale, brokering or distribution of manufactured homes, primarily to a person who, in good faith, purchases these homes for purposes other than resale.',
     '0', '1', '0', '1', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008311', '008',
     'Manufactured Housing Developer Dealer', '"Developer Dealer" means a person who purchases state-certified manufactured housing from a licensed manufacturer or dealer for placement on property owned by the developer dealer and who offers the manufactured housing for sale to the initial purchaser of the manufactured housing. The developer dealer may not install such manufactured housing but may contract with the manufacturer or dealer for the installation of such manufactured housing.',
     '0', '1', '0', '1', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008312', '008',
     'Manufactured Housing Manufacturer', 'A manufacturer licensed by the Department of Professional and Financial Regulation is engaged in manufacturing or producing manufactured housing and then selling it to a dealer.',
     '0', '1', '0', '1', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008313', '008',
     'Manufactured Housing Communities', 'A manufactured housing community licensed by the Department of Professional and Financial Regulation is a parcel or adjoining parcel of land, under single ownership, that has been planned and improved for the placement of 3 or more mobile homes, but does not include a construction camp.',
     '0', '0', '0', '9', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008314', '008',
     'Multi-Level Long Term Care Facility Administrator', 'A "Multi-Level Long Term Care Facility Administrator" is a licensed individual who has responsibility for the general administration of a Multi-Level Long Term Care Facility, a Nursing Home, or a Residential Care Facility. A "Multi-Level Long Term Care Facility" is a medical care facility, other than a hospital, that provides more than one level of long term care, including care levels normally associated with nursing homes and those associated with residential care / assisted living.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008315', '008',
     'Residential Care Facility Administrator', '"Residential Care Facility Administrator" is an individual who has responsibility for the general administration of a residential care facility. A residential care facility refers to a Level II Residential Care Facility having a licensed capacity for seven or more residents, and whose services provided fall within the definition of a medical care facility other than a hospital.',
     '1', '2', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008316', '008',
     'Nursing Home Administrator-In-Training', '"Administrator-in-Training" means an individual who meets the qualifications set forth in rules by the board, is engaged in a training program defined in rules and approved by the board and is under the supervision of a preceptor also approved by the board.',
     '4', '2', '0', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008317', '008',
     'Limited Tank Installer', 'A limited tank installer''s license is for the limited purpose of allowing a manufactured housing mechanic licensed by the Manufactured Housing Board to install outside residential heating oil tanks at manufactured housing. The board may issue a joint limited license to a licensed manufactured housing dealer by the Manufactured Housing Board and an individual employee of the dealer who is named as the corecipient of the joint limited license for the limited purpose of installing outside residential heating oil tanks at manufactured housing that has been sold by the dealer.',
     '0', '1', '0', '9', '2',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '3', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008318', '008',
     'Limited Wood Pellet Technician', 'A limited wood pellet technician''s privileges to practice are restricted to cleaning the ash pan, cleaning the burn pot, scraping and cleaning the distribution tubes, emptying fines from the collection box and cleaning the fan.',
     '1', '9', '9', '9', '9',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008319', '008',
     'Gas Dispensing Station', 'A dispensing station is a facility consisting of fixed equipment where propane or natural gas is stored and dispensed into portable containers.',
     '0', '0', '0', '9', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '2', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008320', '008',
     'Oil Limited Energy Auditor Technician', 'An oil limited energy auditor technician''s license is for the limited purpose of performing combustion safety and efficiency testing on oil-fired heating or oil-fired water heating equipment. Limited energy auditor technicians may not make any adjustments to oil-fired heating or oil-fired water heating equipment.',
     '2', '1', '0', '9', '0',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008321', '008',
     'Gas Storage Tank Permit', 'The board shall inspect and issue permits to aboveground and underground propane and natural gas storage facilities and rooftop installations of ASME containers.',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008322', '008',
     'Propane Limited Energy Auditor Technician', 'A propane limited energy auditor technician''s license is for the limited purpose of performing combustion safety and efficiency testing on natural gas-fired or propane gas-fired space heating or water heating equipment. Limited energy auditor technicians may not make any adjustments to natural gas-fired or propane gas-fired space heating or water heating equipment.',
     '2', '1', '0', '9', '0',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008323', '008',
     'Propane and Natural Gas Helper', 'A propane and natural gas helper is a person licensed by the board to assist a licensed technician. A helper must work under the direct and continuous supervision of a licensed technician on-site.',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008324', '008',
     'Temporary Permit For Plant Operator And/or Delivery Technician', 'A temporary permit for a plant operator and/or a delivery technician is issued to a person that files an application with the board. The applicant must register with the board within 90 days of hire and become licensed within one year. An applicant may only apply and receive one temporary permit every three years.',
     '4', '1', '0', '9', '9',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '008325', '008',
     'Limited Radiographer', 'A limited radiographer is defined as a person other than a licensed practitioner who applies x-radiation to specific parts of the human body, for diagnostic purposes while under the supervision of a licensed practitioner.',
     '2', '1', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220622'),
    ('23', '01', '010001', '010',
     'Attorney', 'An attorney is a person who is legally qualified and licensed to represent a person in a legal matter, such as a transaction or lawsuit.',
     '2', '2', '2', '9', '9',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '011001', '011',
     'Body Piercer', 'Body piercers advise on suitable types of metal and jewelry, sterilize the piece of jewelry and the area which is being pierced, and dispose of the needle, all while following health and safety guidelines.',
     '0', '1', '9', '0', '2',
     '1', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '011002', '011',
     'Combined Body Piercing & Tattoo', 'See pages for "Tattoo Artist" and "Body Piercing" licenses.',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '2',
     '1', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '011003', '011',
     'Micropigmentation', 'Micropigmentation is the process of placing very small granules of pigment under the skin.',
     '0', '1', '9', '9', '2',
     '1', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '011004', '011',
     'Tattoo Artist', 'Using needles and pigments, a tattoo artist applies a permanent design directly to a client''s body, injecting ink under a layer of skin.',
     '0', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '1', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '011005', '011',
     'Electrologist', 'Electrologists permanently remove unwanted hair from the face and body of their clients and patients through the use of electrolysis.',
     '0', '1', '2', '1', '0',
     '1', '0', '9', 'D', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '012001', '012',
     'Certified Nursing Assistants', 'Certified nursing assistants assist RNs in their duties. To be placed on the Maine CNA Registry, you must be able to provide official documentation of formal CNA training that meets Maine’s Rules and Regulations as well as Federal OBRA Regulations, whether for immediate placement on the Registry or for completing the “Non-Traditional CNA Competency Testing Evaluation testing.',
