     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220621'),
    ('23', '01', '015004', '015',
     'Whitewater Outfitter', 'A whitewater outfitter means a person or corporation, who conducts commercial whitewater rafting, dory or bateau trips on rapidly flowing rivers or streams and who holds a current license issued by the Department of Inland Fisheries and Wildlife.',
