    ('23', '01', '108305', '008',
     'Helper Electrician, Senior Helper Electrician', 'Electrician helpers support electricians in the maintenance, operation and repair of electrical systems.',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '108306', '008',
     'Limited Electrician, Senior Limited Electrician', 'A limited electrician is an individual licensed to make electrical installations limited to a specific type of electrically operated equipment or to specific electrical installations only authorized by this license.',
     '0', '1', '0', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '108307', '008',
     'Journeyman Electrician, Senior Journeyman Electrician', 'Journey electricians are able to provide electrical repairs and services and are usually on their way to getting a master electrician license.',
     '1', '1', '1', '0', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220616'),
    ('23', '01', '108308', '008',
     'Podiatrist in Residency', 'Podiatrists perform foot and ankle surgeries, prescribe orthotics, and apply therapeutic treatments for issues like arthritis, fractures, and feet corn and calluses. Podiatrist residents assume these responsibilities under supervision.',
     '2', '2', '1', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '108309', '008',
     'Broker Dealer', 'A broker dealer buys and sells securities for their and their customer''s benefit.',
     '2', '0', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '0', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '108310', '008',
     'Special Permit Nuclear Medicine Trainee', 'Nuclear medicine technologist trainees learn under licensed technologists about how to prepare and administer small amounts of radioactive substances called radiopharmaceuticals, as well as other medications, to patients for diagnosis and treatments.',
     '4', '1', '0', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     '4', '20220617'),
    ('23', '01', '108311', '008',
     'Temporary Radiologic Technologist', 'Radiologic technologists use diagnostic imaging equipment to help physicians identify illnesses and injuries. They may use x-ray equipment, computed tomography, magnetic resonance imaging, or mammography to perform X-rays, CT scans, MRIs, or mammograms. This is a temporary license.',
