    ('25', '01', '2500013000', '069',
     'HOME INSPECTOR', 'The Board is responsible for insuring that licensed home inspectors have proper training and experience through an associates program and meet minimum inspection requirements in each inspection performed. Applicants are required to pass a board approved examination prior to licensure and fulfill continuing education for license renewal. In addition, the board publishes a code of ethics for home inspectors.',
