    ('25', '01', '2513002000', '048',
     'INSURANCE ADVISER', 'Division recommends several years experience in the field (e.g., Life, Accident and Health, or Fire and Casualty) for which examined.
Division recommends current employment in a professional capacity in the insurance business.
At least one other professional designation (i.e., CIC, CPCU, CLU, etc.) is recommended.
Must have a thorough knowledge of the relevant section of Chapter 175 of the General Laws, and be familiar with rates, rating plans, and reserve procedures. 

Exam required. 

No continuing education required, if licensed as an agent or broker. 

Fees required. 

