    ('25', '01', '2568005000', '050',
     'AESTHETICIAN', 'Aesthetician - Type 6. An aesthetician - Type 7 who has had a minimum of two years experience as such may apply to the Board for examination and licensure as an aesthetician Type 6. Such person may supervise individuals licensed as aestheticians - Type 7 only. The license must be renewed on the date determined by the Board.',
