     'ELECTRICIAN, JOURNEYMAN', 'Must have documented proof of 4 years or more as an apprentice under a licensed Massachusetts electrician. Out-of-state experience must be documented on company letterhead.
Must have documented proof of 300 clock hours at a board approved electrical school or an approved daytime trade or vocational school. (On average, one-half of approved school time may be applied towards the apprenticeship). 

