    ('25', '01', '2587899011', '038',
     'ASBESTOS SUPERVISOR', 'Certification as an Asbestos Supervisor authorizes an individual or employee of an asbestos abatement entity to have managerial or supervisory authority over asbestos workers, and/or have the responsibility for the completion of asbestos response actions or portions thereof.',
