    ('25', '01', '2595026000', '044',
     'NUCLEAR POWER PLANT ASSISTANT OPERATOR', 'Assists in controlling a nuclear reactor which produces steam for generation of electrical power and in operation of auxiliary equipment.

REQUIREMENT:

    U. S. Citizen or intent to become one
    18 years of age minimum
    Good moral Character
    Professional Must have been employed in a steam power plant as a fireman, water tender, control room assistant, or as a designated assistant to the engineer in charge for not less than one year. Must provide written endorsement of training/experience by a person holding a steam power or nuclear power plant engineer''s license.

    Examination:
    Must pass a written exam and an oral exam, offered in September, March and June.',
