    ('25', '01', '2595026002', '044',
     'NUCLEAR POWER PLANT SENIOR ENGINEER/SENIOR SUPERVISOR', 'Supervises and coordinates the activities of workers engaged in operation and control of thermonuclear reactor, turbine generator, and auxiliary equipment at electric generation station. oversees the activities and the training of workers in safety precautions, repair, and maintenance.',
