    ('25', '01', '2597102000', '053',
     'COMMERCIAL DRIVERS', 'This license is required for operation of large commercial vehicles, including buses, tractor trailers, and any commercial vehicle 26,001 pounds or more. Also, includes any vehicle required to be placarded for hazardous materials.',
