    ('25', '01', '2597108000', '058',
     'BUS DRIVER', 'The driver of a motor bus shall be at least 18 years of age and must obtain a motor bus driver''s certificate from the Department, in addition to obtaining a properly classified operator''s license issued by the Registrar of Motor Vehicles.  They shall carry with 
