<div style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><strong><span style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);"><br /></span></strong></div>
<div style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><strong><span style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Nonresident with an Active License in a Reciprocal State
<br />
<br /></span></strong>
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">The applicant must reside in and hold an active real estate license in one of the following reciprocal States: Colorado, Iowa, Nebraska, North Dakota, South Dakota, and Oklahoma.</strong></p>
<ol style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Contact a Minnesota-licensed primary broker in order to submit an application for licensure onÂ <a href="https://www.pulseportal.com/" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 56, 101);">PULSE Portal</a>. Only a Minnesota-licensed primary broker can submit an application for a nonresident salespersonâ??s license.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">The license fee is $130.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;"><a href="mailto:licensing.commerce@state.mn.us" title="Email a Letter of Certification" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 56, 101);">Email a Letter of Certification</a>Â (no more than 90 days old) documenting that you are currently licensed as a salesperson in a reciprocal state.
<br />
<br /></li>
</ol>
<strong><span style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Nonresident with an Active License in Wisconsin
<br />
<br /></span></strong>
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">The applicant must reside and hold an active real estate license in Wisconsin.</strong></p>
<ol style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Complete the 13 hour Wisconsin to Minnesota Reciprocal Prelicense course.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Â You can find course offerings atÂ <a href="https://www.pulseportal.com/" style="color: rgb(0, 56, 101); background: transparent; box-sizing: border-box;">PULSE Portal</a>
<br style="box-sizing: border-box;" />
<br style="box-sizing: border-box;" /></li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">The course cannot be more than one year old at the time of application for licensure.Â </li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Pass the state portion of the salesperson exam.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Schedule exam withÂ <a href="https://home.pearsonvue.com/mncommerce" title="Schedule the exam with Pearson Vue" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 56, 101);">Pearson Vue</a>Â (1-833-273-1946).</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Contact a Minnesota-licensed primary broker in order to submit an application for licensure onÂ <a href="https://www.pulseportal.com/" style="color: rgb(0, 56, 101); background: transparent; box-sizing: border-box;">PULSE Portal</a>. Only a Minnesota-licensed primary broker can submit an application for a nonresident salespersonâ??s license.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">The license fee is $130.Â </li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;"><a href="mailto:licensing.commerce@state.mn.us" title="Email a Letter of Certification" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 56, 101);">Email a Letter of Certification</a>Â (no more than 90 days old) documenting that you are currently licensed as a salesperson in Wisconsin.Â 
<br />
<br /></li>
</ol>
<strong><span style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Nonresident with an active license in a Non-Reciprocal State
<br />
<br /></span></strong>
<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">The applicant must reside and hold an active license in a non-reciprocal state.</strong></p>
<ol style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Complete pre-licensing education Course I, Course II, and Course III.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Course offerings can be found atÂ Â <a href="https://www.pulseportal.com/">PULSE Portal</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Pass the state portion of the salesperson exam.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Schedule the exam withÂ <a href="https://home.pearsonvue.com/mncommerce" style="color: rgb(0, 56, 101); background: transparent; box-sizing: border-box;">Pearson Vue</a>Â (1-833-273-1946).</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">Contact a Minnesota-licensed primary broker in order to submit an application for licensure onÂ <a href="https://www.pulseportal.com/" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 56, 101);">PULSE Portal</a>. Only a Minnesota-licensed primary broker can submit an application for a nonresident salespersonâ??s license.
<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 18px !important; padding-bottom: 0px !important;">
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;">The license fee is $130.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px; list-style: inherit;"><a href="mailto:licensing.commerce@state.mn.us" title="Email a Letter of Certification" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 56, 101);">Email a Letter of Certification</a>Â (no more than 90 days old) documenting that you are currently licensed as a salesperson in non-reciprocal state.Â </li>
</ol>
</div> None',
