    ('26', '01', '8703211012', '710',
     'School Counselor', 'School Counselors must complete at least 30 graduate level semester hours in an approved school counselor education program, complete at least 600 hours of internship, and pass the Michigan Certification Examination. The fee for this license is $160.00.',
