    ('26', '01', '8782984556', '710',
     'Administrator Certification', 'To become a standard school administrator, a candidate must possess a master''s degree or higher from an accredited program in addition to completing training course with the Michigan Deparment of Eduation. The fee for this license is $50.00.',
