     'Journeyman (Conditional/Limited/Journeyman) Sprinkler Fitter Certification', 'A person who is licensed as competent to engage in installing, connecting, altering, repairing or adding to a fire protection system for and under the supervision of a fire protection contractor. Minnesota Department of Public Safety (DPS) - State Fire Marshal Review Fire Sprinklers None',
