     'Exporting Minnow Dealer License', 'Minnesota Department of Natural Resources (DNR)  <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A <a href="https://mn.gov/elicense/agencies/#/detail/appId/0/id/230765">minnow dealer</a> must obtain an exporting minnow dealer license to transport minnows (taken under their minnow dealer license) out of the state. Leeches are considered and defined as minnows. Vehicles being used to export minnows out of state are required to be licensed as <a href="https://mn.gov/elicense/agencies/#/detail/appId/0/id/230787">Exporting Minnow Dealer Vehicles</a></p>
