    ('28', '01', '206ChirAst', '206',
     'Chiropractic Assistant', 'Applying for Certification Chiropractic Assistant (CA)    [Reference: Section 73-6-5(2)]    Qualifications:  High School diploma or GED equivalent    Complete the online CA Registration Form and submit it online within seven (7) days of employment.    Payment of $50.00 registration fee (money order or cashier''s check) within sixty (60) days of employment.   Receiving 6 hours of continuing education within 6 months of employment.   Renewal fee is $50.00.   Late fee, if paid after June 30, is $100.00',
