     'Private Investigator', 'Applicants must:
1)  Be at least 21 years old and of good moral character.
2)  Undergo a background check through FBI and DPS.
3)  Have no criminal or felony convictions involving moral turpitude or illegal use or possession of a dangerous weapon.
4)  Have 5 years (10,000 hours) of investigative experience certified by their employer, or a combination of education and experience acceptable to the board.
5)  Pass a State Board examination with a score of 75% or better.
