    ('32', '01', '19903', '199',
     'Athlete''s Agent', 'Athlete''s agents must hold a certificate of registration in Nevada.  For information, application form and instructions visit the Division website.

Fees are subject to change.  Fees are: application Fee --$500; biennial renewal--$500.',
