     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.ndow.org/', '20160114'),
    ('32', '01', '20304', '203',
     'Hunters, Trappers and Fur Dealers', 'Hunting, trapping and fur dealing requires licensure.  There are many different categories of licenses and permits depending on the wildlife and its status.  Certain unprotected species do not require licensure to hunt.  Visit the Department of Wildlife website for more information.',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
