     'Nurse, Registered (RN)', '<p>Registered Nurses (RN) use the principles of biological, physical and behavioral science in assessing and identifying the physical and psychosocial health status of the patient/consumer. Provide for the maintenance of health and the prevention of illness through teaching, counseling, and services supportive to the continuance or improvement of health and well being. The professional nurse teaches and directs the nursing care provider in implementing therapeutic plans of care to effectively carry out the nursing regimen and collaborates with the physician, advanced practice registered nurse, or dentist in the implementation of the medical regimen.</p>
