    ('36', '01', '155', '8',
     'Title Insurance Agent', 'A title insurance agent, representing the insurer, sells, solicits, or negotiates title insurance policies, to owners of, and persons lawfully interested in, real property, to protect against loss by reason of defective titles, including liens and encumbrances on such titles.',
