    ('36', '01', '156', '22',
     'Truck Driver, Heavy or Tractor Trailer', 'Drivers of heavy trucks or tractor trailers may operate vehicles with a Vehicle Weight Rating (GVWR), or the Gross Combination Weight Rating (GCWR) of over 26,000 pounds by obtaining the appropriate Commercial Driver''s License (CDL) with the proper endorsements.',
