     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/nursing/licensure.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1065', '127',
     'Nurse, Licensed Practical', 'The practice of licensed practical nursing means:
(1)The performance of any acts in the care, treatment, or observation of the ill, injured or infirm;
(2)Maintenance of health of others and promotion of health care;
 (3)Assisting with health counseling',
     '1', '2', '2', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/nursing/licensure.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1066', '127',
     'Nurse, Registered', 'A registered nurse engages in the nursing diagnosis of human responses to actual or potential health problems of individuals or groups, providing preventative, restorative and supportive care, health teaching and counseling, case finding and referral.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/nursing/licensure.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1067', '128',
     'Nursing Facility Administrator', 'A person who administers, manages, supervises, or is in general administrative charge of a nursing facility, whether the individual has an ownership interest in such facility and whether the function and duties are shared with one or more individuals.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/nursingfacility/apps.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1068', '125',
     'Occupaitonal Therapist', 'A health professional who meets the qualifications and is licensed by the Board. The occupational therapist assesses patients persons with disabilities or developmental delays, then organizes and implements rehabilitative programs to help the patients build or restore vocational, homemaking and daily living skills, as well as general independence.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.sdbmoe.gov/', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1069', '125',
     'Occupational Therapy Assistant', 'Any person licensed to assist in the practice of occupational therapy, under the supervision of or with the consultation of a licensed occupational therapist and whose license is in good standing',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.sdbmoe.gov/', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1070', '127',
     'Certified Registered Nurse Anesthetist', 'A certified registered nurse anesthetist, in addition to performing all those functions within the scope of practice of a registered nurse as provided in this chapter, may perform the following functions in collaboration with a physician licensed pursuant.',
     '1', '2', '2', '0', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/nursing/licensure.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1071', '129',
     'Optometrist', 'The practice of optometry is declared to be a profession and defined as examination of the human eye and its appendages, and the employment of any means for the measurement of the powers of visions, or any visual, muscular, neurological or interpretative.',
     '1', '2', '1', '1', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/optometry/licensing.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1072', '125',
     'Osteopath', 'A doctor of osteopathy licensed by the board.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.sdbmoe.gov/', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1073', '127',
     'Clinical Nurse Specialist', 'The practice of a licensed clinical nurse specialist, by means of graduate education in nursing and additional clinical preparation which provides for knowledge, judgment, and skills beyond that required of a registered nurse.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/nursing/licensure.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1074', '115',
     'Commercial Pesticide Applicator', 'Any certified applicator who uses any pesticide on any property other than as a private applicator.',
     '1', '1', '0', '9', '9',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     'https://danr.sd.gov/Agriculture/Inspection/Pesticide/default.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1075', '130',
     'Pharmacist', 'An individual engaged in the practice of providing drug therapy and other pharmaceutical patient care services intended to achieve outcomes related to cure or prevention of a disease, elimination or reduction of a patient''s symptoms.',
     '1', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '1', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/pharmacy/pharmacist.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1076', '130',
     'Pharmacy Technician', 'A person registered by the board who is employed by a pharmacy to assist licensed pharmacists in the practice of pharmacy by performing specific tasks delegated by and under the immediate personal supervision and control of a licensed pharmacist.',
     '1', '2', '0', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://doh.sd.gov/boards/pharmacy/technicianreqs.aspx', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1077', '125',
     'Physical Therapist', 'The practice of physical therapy is the examination and evaluation of patients with mechanical, physiological, and developmental impairments, functional limitation, and disability or other similar conditions in order to determine a diagnosis, prognosis and treatment.',
     '1', '2', '2', '0', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.sdbmoe.gov/', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1078', '125',
     'Physical Therapy Assistants', 'A person who is a graduate of an accredited physical therapist assistant education program as determined by the board, who has passed a certification examination approved by the board, and who assists in providing physical therapy services.',
     '1', '1', '2', '1', '0',
     '9', '2', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.sdbmoe.gov/', '20240522'),
    ('46', '01', '1298', '145',
     'Investment Adviser', 'A person who, for compensation, engages in the business of advising others, either directly or through publications or writings, as to the value of securities or the advisability of investing in, purchasing, or selling securities.',
     '1', '9', '9', '9', '0',
