    ('47', '01', '1700000007', '19',
     'SPRINKLER SYS CONTRACTOR,   RESPONSIBLE MANAGING EMPLOYEES', 'SPRINKLER SYSTEM CONTRACTOR, RESPONSIBLE MANAGING EMPLOYEES (RME)<br><br>A fire protection sprinkler system contractor RME is designated to be in active and responsible charge of the work of the fire protection sprinkler system contractor.  [An architect who functions as a fire protection sprinkler system contractor''s responsible managing employee (RME) must also be licensed for this occupation.]<br><br>REQUIREMENTS:<br>Be at least 18 years of age; licensed as an Architect or Engineer in the State of Tennessee; or satisfy examination requirement.<br><br>EXAMINATION REQUIREMENTS:<br>Successful completion of the examination administered by the National Institute for Certification of Engineering Technology (NICET) Complete  requirements for certification at Level III for fire protection automatic sprinkler systems layout.  (Architects and Engineers licensed in Tennessee are exempt from the examination requirement.)<br><br>For further information contact:<br>NICET<br>1420 King Street<br>Alexandria, VA  22314<br>(703)684-2837<br><br>RENEWAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>Annual renewal is required.',
