     'PEST CONTROL CONSULTANT', 'PEST CONTROL CONSULTANT<br><br>A pest control consultant offers consultation to operators and aerial applicators in a field of pest control. A consultant is not authorized to apply pesticides for a fee. <br><br>REQUIREMENTS: <br>Must be commercially certified and prove to the satisfaction of the Pest Control Board that he/she possesses sufficient education to perform as a licensed consultant. This most frequently is proof of a four-year degree in the field of pest control in which consultation is offered, such as entomology. <br><br>RENEWAL REQUIREMENTS: <br>Contact the licensing authority.',
