     'No URL Provided', '20240909'),
    ('47', '01', '1900000011', '50',
     'Researcher', 'RESEARCHER <br><br>This certification is obtained by a licensed professional wishing to conduct research under the guidance of the board of pharmacy in the state of Tennessee.  The researcher must have a reporting facility listed for which research or study is responsible for coordination and security of drugs.<br><br>REQUIREMENTS:<br>Must complete an online or paper application, provide a declaration of citizenship form signed and notarized, a copy of their valid government issued identification, resume, and protocol with fee.  To qualify for this certification, fitness and competency requirements as specified by the board including chemical substance history must be provided.   Applicant when applying must provide extensive protocol documentation for the specific research to be undertaken to board''s satisfaction when applying.<br><br>EDUCATIONAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>Those requesting must possess basic educational qualification and meet professional, ethical and other qualifications.<br><br> EXAMINATION REQUIREMENTS:<br>Not listed<br><br>CONTINUING EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS:<br>Not listed<br><br>RENEWAL: <br><br>PROFESSIONAL ORGANIZATIONS<br>',
