     'No URL Provided', '20240909'),
    ('47', '01', '2100000008', '21',
     'SCHOOL SERVICES PERSONNEL', 'SCHOOL SERVICES PERSONNEL<br><br>School Services Personnel support school administrators, teachers, other school services personnel, and families in addressing the needs of students in multiple academic, interpersonal, social and health-related areas. School Services Personnel serve in many specialized functions including: School Counselors, School Psychologists, School Social Workers, School Audiologists, and School Speech Language Pathologists. <br><br>REQUIREMENTS:<br>Be at least 18 years old and satisfy education and examination requirements. Contact license authority for additional requirements for endorsements.<br><br>EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS:<br>Completion of school services personnel program in specialized area at an approved educator preparation provider. Contact the licensing authority for additional requirements for endorsements.<br><br>EXAMINATION REQUIREMENTS:<br>Praxis Exams administered by the Educational Testing Services.<br><br>RECIPROCITY WITH OTHER STATES: <br>Yes<br><br>PROFESSIONAL ORGANIZATIONS:<br>Tennessee Education Association<br>801 Second Avenue North<br>Nashville, TN 37219<br>(615) 242-8392',
