     'LICENSED MARITAL AND FAMILY THERAPIST', 'LICENSED MARITAL AND FAMILY THERAPIST<br><br>      A professional counselor licensed under this part and designated as a mental health service provider must have: (1) completed coursework specifically related to the diagnosis, treatment, appraisal, and assessment of mental disorders; and (2) completed two years of postgraduate supervised experience required for licensure in a clinical setting that provides substantial opportunities to diagnose, treat, appraise, and assess mental disorders.',
