     'BOXING PARTICIPANT', 'BOXING PARTICIPANT<BR><BR>Trains and manages professional boxers, or assists them in the ring between rounds of a professional boxing match.<BR><BR>CERTIFICATION REQUIREMENTS:<BR>Boxing participants are required to pay a licensing fee of $100 for managers, $25 for boxing seconds, and $100 for matchmakers. An additional $50 fee is required for application. Two photographs are to be included with the application information. States or localities where a license has been held and the length those licenses have been active must be included in the application paperwork.',
