    ('47', '01', '2700000013', '64',
     'BOXING RING OFFICIAL', 'BOXING RING OFFICIAL<BR><BR>Acts as a judge, referee, or timekeepers at a professional boxing or sparring contest.<BR><BR>CERTIFICATION REQUIREMENTS:<BR>Ring Officials are required to pay a licensing fee of $75 for referees, $50 for judges, $0 for physicians, $100 for announcers, and $50 for timekeepers. An additional $50 fee is required for application. Two photographs must be submitted with licensing paperwork. Licensing requires that the last five years of experience is provided.',
