    ('47', '01', '2900000003', '87',
     'ADVANCED PRACTICE REGISTERED NURSE', 'ADVANCED PRACTICE REGISTERED NURSE<BR><BR>An Advanced Practice Nurse (APN) is a Tennessee licensed registered nurse who has a master''s degree or higher in a nursing specialty and has national specialty certification as a nurse practitioner, nurse anesthetist, nurse midwife, or clinical nurse specialist.<br><br>EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS:<br>Master''s Degree or higher in one of the four advanced practice nursing roles/categories:  Clinical Nurse Specialist, Nurse Anesthetist, Nurse Midwife, and Nurse Practitioner.<br><br>RENEWAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>Every two years, current national specialty certification, RN license and maintains competency requirements.  http://www.state.tn.us/sos/rules/1000/1000-04.pdf',
