     'CERTIFIED ANIMAL EUTHANASIA TECHNICIAN', 'CERTIFIED ANIMAL EUTHANASIA TECHNICIAN <BR>A person employed by a certified animal control agency who is authorized by the Board of Veterinary Medical Examiners to humanely euthanize animals by administering those drugs approved by the Board. <BR><BR>REQUIREMENTS:<BR>Certificate of completion from a Board-approved course on animal euthanasia.<BR><BR>EXAMINATION REQUIREMENTS:<BR>None.<BR><BR>CONTINUING EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS:<BR>None.',
