     'MASTER BARBER INSTRUCTOR''S ASSISTANT', 'MASTER BARBER INSTRUCTOR''S  ASSISTANT<br><br>A registered master barber certified by the board as a barber instructor assistant.  Employment as a barber instructor assistant is limited to three years.<br><br>PROSPECTIVE:<br>Every barber school must have one licensed barber instructor for each barber instructor assistant. <br><br>REQUIREMENTS:<br>Hold a valid certificate of registration as a master barber and meets the education and examination requirements.<br><br>EDUCATIONAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>Completion of tenth grade in an accredited school or equivalent, and current enrollment in a four hundred fifty-hour instructor training program at a board-certified barber school. Total Included with Masterbarber.',
