     'REAL ESTATE ACQUISITION AGENT', 'REAL ESTATE ACQUISITION AGENT <BR><BR>Acquisition agent  means a person who by means of personal inducement, solicitation, or otherwise attempts directly to encourage any person to attend a sales presentation for a time-share program; provided, however,  that acquisition agent" shall not include any person or that person''s employee who engages in any such activity solely on real property owned or leased by such person on or within the premises of a hotel, motel,  private resort, or lodging rental office or phone or mail solicitation business.<BR><BR>REQUIREMENTS:<BR>Be at least 18 years of age, a resident of the state, have a reputation for honesty, trustworthiness, and integrity and the competence to transact the business of time share salesperson and satisfy education and examination requirements.<BR><BR>EDUCATION REQUIREMENTS:<BR>A 30 hour training program consisting of instruction in the fundamentals of the Tennessee Time Share Act and related topics.<BR><BR>EXAMINATION REQUIREMENTS:<BR>Successful completion of a written examination.<BR>(The examination is administered by Assessment System Inc. (800) 274-0999).',
