     'BID CALLER', 'BID CALLER:<br><br>Bid caller auctioneer means an individual who, for compensation or valuable consideration, or otherwise, is hired by a principal auctioneer, public automobile auction, or public automobile auctioneer to solicit bids for the purchase of goods at an auction, usually using a rapid oral exchange with bidders, accepting bids, and asking for further bids, ultimately declaring the subject property sold. <br><br> REQUIREMENTS: <br> Complete an online application, be eighteen years of age, and take a sixteen hour course on Basic Fundamentals in Auctioneering.',
