     'SMALL WATER SYSTEM OPERATOR', 'SMALL WATER SYSTEM OPERATOR<br><br>Person qualified to control the manipulation of equipment and thereby determine the quality and quantity of the water supplied by a water distribution system that is classified as a small water system. <br><br>PROSPECTIVE: <br>Certification is required for persons in direct charge of small water systems. <br><br>REQUIREMENTS:<br>An applicant must have a high school education and work in a water system classified as a small water system for at least three months and must meet the examination requirements. <br><br>EXAMINATIONS: <br>Examinations are written (except accommodations made for disability). They may contain matching, multiple choice, true-false, discussion, and short answer questions and may contain problems. 70% is required to pass.',
