    ('48', '01', 'R33', '77',
     'Racing -- Multiple Owner', 'For use if the owner according to the animal''s registration papers is an entity other than an individual, such as a partnership, stable, farm name. Each individual who owns 5% or more of the race animal must be individually licensed.  The animal will not be permitted to race until all those individuals are licensed.  If the race animal is owned jointly by a husband and wife, with the same last name, registration on this form is not required.',
