    ('50', '01', 'adacounapp', 's41',
     'Certified Apprentice Addiction Professional', 'Guides and assists persons affected by problems related to the use of alcohol and/or drugs.  Serves as a supervised apprentice at an ADAP Certified Provider only and not at any other setting.',
