    ('50', '01', 'appbehanal', 's42',
     'Applied Behavior Analyst', 'Evaluate, design, and implement individualized protocols  to improve skills.  A primary focus is the evaluation of the relationship between a behavior and environmental factors.  Apply techniques such as positive reinforcement to assist their clients in developing new behaviors, modifying existing behaviors, and exhibiting behaviors under specific conditions.  May supervise assistant behavior analysts.',
     '0', '2', '1', '0', '2',
