    ('50', '01', 'boxerref', 's08',
     'Professional Boxing Referee', 'Enforcing the rules, instructs both fighters before the bout, determines when to stop or start a contest, determines when a foul is intentional or accidental, determines whether to warn an offending fighter or deduct a point, and determines when and if an unarmed combatant can continue the bout.',
