    ('50', '01', 'boxersec', 's08',
     'Professional Boxing Seconds', 'Assists boxers with treatment of injuries and offer advice after each round. They are only allowed to enter the ring at the end of a round, and normally sit on the outside of the ring by their boxer’s corner. They cannot coach boxers during the contest.',
     '0', '0', '0', '0', '0',
