    ('51', '01', '0000000002', '030',
     'Accountant, Certified Public (CPA) Certification', 'In order to use the CPA title in Virginia, an individual must be licensed in Virginia or a substantially equivalent state or jurisdiction. An individual must hold a CPA license in Virginia if providing services to the public and the principal place of business in which those services are provided is in Virginia.',
