    ('51', '01', '0000000106', '005',
     'Esthetician, Master License and Master Esthetics Instructor Certificate', 'The Board for Barbers and Cosmetology licenses individuals and businesses that perform barbering, cosmetology, nail care, waxing, tattooing, body piercing, and esthetics. The Board also regulates individuals who teach and schools that provide training in those areas.',
     '3', '0', '1', '0', '0',
