    ('51', '01', '0000000141', '037',
     'Limited Professorial License/LimitedFellow License to Practice Medicine', 'Pursuant to 54.1-2936, the Board may issue a limited license to practice medicine as a full-time fellow or a full-time faculty member, to certain graduates of foreign medical schools.',
     '4', '0', '2', '0', '9',
