     'https://www.osha.gov/laws-regs', '20230811'),
    ('51', '01', '0000000181', '033',
     'Peer Recovery Specialist, Registered', 'The General Assembly authorized the Board of Counseling in 2017 to register Peer Recovery Specialists (RPRS). Effective January 3, 2018, individuals are able to apply for RPRS registration by submitting an online application, fee and supplemental documentation with the Board of Counseling.  (Please note that RPRS credential is a registration and not a license.)',
