     'https://www.dhp.virginia.gov/Boards/Medicine', '20230811'),
    ('51', '01', '0000000244', '005',
     'Tattooing School License', 'Any firm wishing to operate a barber, cosmetology, nail technician, or wax technician school shall
submit an application to the board at least 60 days prior to the date for which approval is sought, obtain a
school license in compliance with § 54.1-704.2 of the Code of Virginia',
