    ('51', '01', '0000000207', '037',
     'Radiologist Assistant License', 'The Virginia Board of Medicine consists of an 18-member Board, eleven professional Advisory Boards, as well as administrative, enforcement, licensing, and support staff. We license and regulate Doctors of Medicine, Osteopathic Medicine, Podiatry, Chiropractic and numerous other Allied professions.',
     '0', '2', '1', '1', '0',
