    ('51', '01', '0000000259', '011',
     'Waterworks Operator License', 'The Board for Waterworks and Wastewater Works Operators and Onsite Sewage System Professionals (WWWOOSSP Board) licenses individuals who operate water and wastewater treatment facilities, as well as onsite soil evaluators, onsite sewage system installers, and onsite sewage system operators. The 11-member board is composed of licensed practitioners, the director of the Virginia Department of Health''s Office of Water Programs, the executive director of the State Water Control Board, and one citizen.',
