    ('51', '01', '0000000262', '005',
     'Waxing Salon License', 'Any firm wishing to operate a barbershop, cosmetology salon, nail salon, or waxing salon shall obtain a
shop or salon license in compliance with § 54.1-704.1 of the Code of Virginia',
