    ('51', '01', '0000000264', '009',
     'Wetland Delineator, Professional Certification', 'The Board for Professional Soil Scientists, Wetland Professionals, and Geologists is composed of three professional soil scientists, three wetland delineators, three geologists, two citizen members, and the State Geologist.',
