    ('53', '01', 'L112', '7',
     'Pharmacist Assistant', 'Individuals must be employed in a pharmacy, in a position with access to drugs and patient specific information. Individuals must list states where credentials were granted and were applied for, provide information on physical and mental health, lack of impairment due to chemical dependency, any felony convictions or loss or limitations of privileges, any disciplinary actions and a professional liability claims history. Individuals must submit application and pay required fee.',
     '0', '2', '0', '1', '0',
     '3', '4', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/ProfessionsNewReneworUpdate/Pharmacist.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L113', '7',
     'Physical Therapist', 'Individuals must have graduated from a nationally accredited, board certified school, must have a passing score on the National Physical Therapy examiniation, must provide a complete work history from receipt of physical therapy degree. Individuals must list states where credentials were granted and were applied for, provide information on physical and mental health, lack of impairment due to chemical dependency, any felony convictions or loss or limitations of privileges, any disciplinary actions and a professional liability claims history. Individuals must submit application and pay required fee.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '0', '4', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/ProfessionsNewReneworUpdate/PhysicalTherapist.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L114', '9',
     'Physican (Boxing, Wrestling, Martial Arts)', 'Individuals must be at least 18 years old, must complete a combative sports license application and pay the required fee.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '9',
     '2', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.dol.wa.gov/business/athletics/contact.html', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L115', '7',
     'Physician Assistant', 'Individuals must have a physican assistant degree from a program accredited by the Accreditation Review Committee on Education for the Physician Assistant or the Commission on Accreditation of Allied Health Education Programs or the Committee on Allied Health Education and Accreditation, successful completion of the national examination given by the National Commission on Certification of Physician Assistants. The individual must be of good moral character. Individuals must submit the required application and pay the required fee.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '2',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/MedicalCommission.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L01', '2',
     'Accountant', 'Individuals qualify as certified public accountants (CPA) . To be eligible to be a CPA, an individual must pass the CPA exam and have completed at least 150 semester credits of college education, including: A B.A.e degree or higher 24 semester credits in accounting subjects with 15 credits at the upper or graduate level and 24 semester credits in business administration subjects.',
     '0', '2', '2', '0', '2',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.cpaboard.wa.gov', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L02', '7',
     'Acupuncturist (East Asian Medicine Practitioner)', 'Acupuncturists provide East Asian medical diagnosis and treatment to patients, including acupuncture, moxibustion and other treatments. Licensure requires a description of science education, East Asian medical education and professional experience.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/ProfessionsNewReneworUpdate/EastAsianMedicinePractitioner.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L03', '12',
     'Adjuster (Insurance)', 'Individuals must have completed the required 20 hours of coursework for each line of insurance to be involved in, taken and passed the required examination, be 18, and be fingerprinted.',
     '0', '1', '9', '9', '0',
     '9', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.insurance.wa.gov/for-industry-professionals/', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L04', '8',
     'Administrator (Electrical)', 'Individuals must take and pass the administrator examination, pay the required fee and fill out the required form.',
     '0', '1', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.lni.wa.gov/TradesLicensing/Electrical/LicenseExamEd/LicenseCert/ElectricalAdmin/default.asp', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L05', '8',
     'Administrator (Telecommunications)', 'Individuals must take and pass the administrator examination, pay the required fee',
     '0', '9', '9', '9', '9',
     '9', '9', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.lni.wa.gov/TradesLicensing/Electrical/LicenseExamEd/LicenseCert/TelecommAdmin/default.asp', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L06', '7',
     'Advanced Registered Nurse Practitioner', 'Advanced Practice Registered Nurses (ARNPs) are independent in their scope of medical practice including full prescription authority. They must pass the required examiniation, pay the required fee and fill out the required form.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/NursingCommission.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L07', '12',
     'Agent (Insurance)', 'Insurance agents solicit, negoitiation and/or sell insurance contracts. They are licensed by line of insurance and activity and are licensed as "producers".',
     '0', '1', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '2', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.insurance.wa.gov/for-industry-professionals/', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L08', '9',
     'Agent (Real Estate)', 'Real estate agents must be at least 18 years old, have a high school diploma or equivalent, sucessfully complete 90 hours of real estate education within 2 years of applying to take the examination, and passing the broker''s examinination.',
     '0', '1', '1', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', 'B', '0',
     'http://www.dol.wa.gov/business/realestate/contact.html', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L09', '9',
     'Agent (Travel)', 'Individuals must register with the state Business Licensing Service before selling or advertising to sell travel services or benefits. Individuals must submit a completed business license application, a completed sellers of travel registration addendum, a seller of travel surety bond (unless the individual is using a trust account) and pay the required licensing fee.',
     '0', '0', '0', '9', '0',
     '0', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.dol.wa.gov/business/travel/tcontact.html', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L10', '9',
     'Agricultural Engineer', 'Individuals must have 8 years of professional-level experience under the direct supervision of a licensed engineer, pass the engineer-in-training examination and Principles and Practices of Engineering examination for the agricultural branch, complete the required application and pay the required fee.',
     '0', '3', '0', '0', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.dol.wa.gov/business/engineerslandsurveyors/contact.html', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L100', '4',
     'Operator of Solid Waste Incinerator and Landfill Facilities', 'Individuals must pass an operator training course and a written examination. Incinerator certifications cost $200 for certification, $50 application fee, $160 textbook costs. Landfill operators must have a high school diploma or GED, must pass the required examination, must have 5 years of MSW management experience and 2 years of operating experience. Certifications last for 3 years. Required courses are taught by the Solid Waste Associaion of North American using private instructors under a memorandum of understanding with the state Department of Ecology.',
     '0', '1', '1', '9', '9',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://apps.ecy.wa.gov/permithandbook/permitdetail.asp?id=55', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L101', '7',
     'Optician', 'Individuals must be at least 18 years old, a graduate of an accredited high school or with a GED, be of good moral character, have completed at least 3 years of apprenticeship training or have sucessfully completed a prescribed course in opticianry in an approved college or university or have been a dispensing optician in another state for 5 years, must submit required application and pay a $200 fee for the required examination.',
     '0', '1', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/ProfessionsNewReneworUpdate/DispensingOptician.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L102', '7',
     'Optometrist', 'Individuals must have graduated from an accredited school of optometry approved by the Washington State Board of Optometry, successfully completed the National Board of Examiners in Optometry Parts I-III and the Treatment and Management of Ocular Disease and have endorsements for DPA/TPA, oral medications and epinephrine by injection. Individuals must list states where credentials were granted and were applied for, provide information on physical and mental health, lack of impairment due to chemical dependency, any felony convictions or loss or limitations of privileges, any disciplinary actions and a professional liability claims history. Individuals must submit application and pay required fee.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '2',
     '0', '4', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/ProfessionsNewReneworUpdate/Optometrist.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L103', '7',
     'Orthopedic', 'Individuals must have graduated from an accredited or approved medical school, completed a residency or other post-graduate training program, provide a work history, provide a list of hospital privileges, have a state medical license, provide required information, pay required fees.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '0', '9', '9', '0',
     'http://www.doh.wa.gov/LicensesPermitsandCertificates/MedicalCommission/MedicalLicensing.aspx', '20240909'),
    ('53', '01', 'L104', '7',
     'Orthotist', 'Individuals must be 18 years old, have a B.A. or certificate program from an approved school, completed a clinical internship or residency of 1,900 hours, completed multiple choice and patient simulation examinations administered by the American Board for Certification in Orthotics and Prosthetices. Individuals must list states where credentials were granted and were applied for, provide information on physical and mental health, lack of impairment due to chemical dependency, any felony convictions or loss or limitations of privileges, any disciplinary actions and a professional liability claims history. Individuals must submit application and pay required fee.',
     '0', '2', '2', '1', '0',
     '2', '4', '9', '9', '0',
