     'Senior EMS Instructor Candidate', 'The EMS and Trauma System section establishes and maintains the integrity of EMS education. We make sure education is up to standard to ensure that Washington’s citizens have reliable, trustworthy emergency care.The senior EMS instructors'' qualification process aims to enhance EMS instruction and to encourage continuing quality improvement.Senior EMS Instructors – WAC 246-976-031 and 032 – these rules provide the requirements necessary to become recognized or to renew recognition as a senior EMS instructor (SEI) in Washington State.If you have any questions about the senior EMS instructor qualification process, call 360-236-2842 or contact us.',
