     'Land Surveyor', 'Individuals must pass the Land Surveyor-in-Training examination, pass the principles and practices of land surveying examinination, pass the Washington 2-hour land surveyor''s examination, have 8 years of professional-level experience under the direct supervision of am licensed land surveyor.',
