    ('53', '01', 'L72', '9',
     'Landscape Architect', 'Individuals must successfully pass the Landscape Architect Registration Examination of the Council of Landscape Architectural Registration Boards, complete the landscape architecture licensure application, provide a written law review related to the practice of landscape architecture, and pay the required fees of $225 for the license application and $360 for the license.',
