Make sure that your name is on the memo of the check and is legible. Please read the information that is attached to the renewal form.
                                        

											Certified checks, corporate checks, money orders are to be mailed to:
											WV Nursing Home Administrator''s Licensing Board 
											PO Box 40447 
											Charleston, WV  25364 



                                        ALL forms such as renewal form, NABVerify Report (not the one with course descriptions-just NAB number, name of course and hrs.)
