Requests for special testing accommodations are made through the NCEES online registration system, My NCEES.

ADA
NCEES provides reasonable accommodations in accordance with the Americans with Disabilities Act and Title VII of the Civil Rights Act as amended. If you have a documented disability, you may apply for special testing accommodations.

Religious
You may request to take the exam on an alternate date due to Sabbath observance.

Military
If you are currently serving as an active duty member of the U.S. Armed Forces, you can request to take an exam in a state or territory different from the one in which you are applying for licensure.

To learn more about these special exam accommodations, please click on the following: http://ncees.org/exams/special-accommodations/








