    ('55', '01', '337', '122',
     'DWELLING CONTRACTOR QUALIFIER', 'Reason for Credential: In order to obtain construction or erosion control building permits for one- and two-family dwellings, a contractor shall possess a Wisconsin Dwelling Contractor Certification (see separate application) and in addition that dwelling contractor shall have an employee, owner, CEO or Chairman of the Board that as an individual holds this Dwelling Contractor Qualifier Certification.',
