Requirements of Credential: The electrical wiring activities that may be undertaken by a person who holds a license or registration as a licensed residential journeyman electrician shall be limited to wiring associated with dwellings, dwelling units and detached accessory buildings and structures serving the dwellings or the dwelling units, such as garages, carports, gazebos and swimming pools.',
