     'CERTIFIED SOCIAL WORKER', 'MENTAL HEALTH AND SUBSTANCE ABUSE SOCIAL WORKERS  SOC 21-1023    Entry Salary  $19.71/hr  Average Salary  $25.25/hr    Job Description  Certified Social Workers apply social work theory and methods to the assessment, diagnosis, treatment and prevention of psychosocial dysfunction, disability or impairment, including emotional and mental disorders, under the supervision of a designated qualified clinical supervisor licensed in the state of Wyoming.    Requirements     1   Age of majority.     2.  Has received a baccalaureate degree in social work.     3. A passing score on the Association of Social Work Boards (ASWB) examination at the Bachelors Level or other examination as may be approved by the Board.    Continuing Education  Licensee must complete a minimum of three hours of continuing education activities in professional ethics and three hours of continuing education activities in suicide assessment and prevention each license renewal cycle.     Restrictions  Felony conviction.  Misdemeanor conviction involving moral turpitude.    School Located in Wyoming  University of Wyoming - Laramie - Division of Social Work  http://www.uwyo.edu/socialwork/  Casper College - Casper - School of Social and Behavioral Sciences - Associates  http://www.caspercollege.edu/sociology/  Central Wyoming College - Riverton - Behavioral and Social Sciences program - Associates  https://www.cwc.edu/programs/socialsciences/  Northwest College - Powell - Social Science program - Associates  https://nwc.edu/academics/programs/social-science  Western Wyoming Community College - Rock Springs - Human and Public Service program - Associates  https://www.westernwyoming.edu/academics/major-programs/human-public-service/index.php    License  Certified Social Workers are certified in Wyoming by the Mental Health Professions Licensing Board.  Licenses expire every two year on licensee birthday.    Examination  The Board accepts The Association of Social Work Boards (ASWB) examination at the Bachelors or Masters level.    Fees  Certification by reciprocity. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$300.00  Certification by examination. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $300.00  Certification renewal. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$100.00 per discipline    Licensing Agency  Mental Health Professions Licensing Board  2001 Capitol Avenue  Emerson Bldg, Rm 105  Cheyenne, WY 82002  Phone: (307) 777-3628  Fax: (307) 777-3508  http://mentalhealth.wyo.gov/            Additional Sources of Information  Association of Social Work Boards  17126 Mountain Run Vista Ct.  Culpeper, Virginia 22701  Phone: (800) 225-6880  http://www.aswb.org/    National Association of Social Workers  750 First St., NE, Ste. 800  Washington, DC 20002-4241  Phone: (800) 742-4089  http://socialworkers.org    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  Social Workers"  http://www.bls.gov/ooh/community-and-social-service/social-workers.htm    Last updated April 2023"',
