     'WATER WELL DRILLING CONTRACTOR', 'EARTH DRILLERS, EXCEPT OIL AND GAS  SOC Code 47-5023    Entry Salary  $24.65/hr  Average Salary  $30.11/hr    Job Description  Water well drilling contractor is any person responsible for or causing the construction, equipping, test pumping or development of any water well for compensation.    Requirements     1.  Must be at least 18 years old.     2.  Must be a United States citizen.     3.  Pass exams prescribed by the Board.     4.  Be of good moral character and repute.     5.  Have proof of current coverage under a general liability insurance policy providing not less than $300,000.    Continuing Education  Licensees must complete 18 hours of continuing education per license renewal period.    Restrictions  Fraud or misrepresentation in obtaining a license.  Has not been convicted of a felony within five years of application for a license.    Training Located in Wyoming  Wyoming Water Well Association,   http://wywaterwell.org/  Contact the Board for additional training providers    License  Water Well Drilling Contractors are licensed by the Wyoming Water Well Contractors Licensing Board.  Licenses are valid for three years and expire on December 31st.    Examination  Three separate exams are required by the Board. All exams are given at times and places determined by the Board. Contact the Board for exam times and places.    Fees  Application (resident). . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . $25.00  Application (nonresident) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . $100.00  License and Registration (for three years) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . $200.00 per license area  Renewal (for three years) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . . $200.00 per license area  Exam fees:     Wyoming -Specific Exam Fee . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . .$75.00      Other exams if taken through National Ground Water Association.  $75.00 per exam for NGWA members                                                                                                                Licensing Agency  Jimmy Gordon  Wyoming Water Well Contractors Licensing Board  PO Box 614  Powell, WY 82435  Phone: (307) 851-7770  http://wwcb.state.wy.us/  wwcb@wyo.gov or jimmy.gordon@wyo.gov    Additional Sources of Information  Wyoming Water Well Association  5947 Road 32  Hawk Springs, WY 82217  http://wywaterwell.org/  wywaterwell@wyobraska.com    National Ground Water Association (NGWA)  601 Dempsey Rd.  Westerville, OH 43081  Phone: (800) 551-7379  http://www.ngwa.org/Pages/default.aspx    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  Earth Drillers Except Oil and Gas"  https://www.bls.gov/oes/current/oes475023.htm    Last updated June 2023"',
