     'WATER WELL PUMP INSTALLATION CONTRACTOR', 'INSTALLATION, MAINTENANCE, AND REPAIR WORKERS, ALL OTHER  SOC Code 49-9099    Entry Salary  $14.86/hr  Average Salary  $19.95/hr    Job Description  Water well pump installation contractor means any person who is in the business of installing pumping equipment in water wells for compensation    Requirements     1.  Must be at least 18 years old.     2.  Must be a United States citizen.     3.  Pass exams prescribed by the Board.     4.  Be of good moral character and repute.     5.  Have proof of current coverage under a general liability insurance policy providing not less than $300,000.    Continuing Education  Licensees must complete 18 hours of continuing education per license renewal period.    Restrictions  Fraud or misrepresentation in obtaining a license.  Has not been convicted of a felony within five years of application for a license.    Training in Wyoming  Wyoming Water Well Association,   http://wywaterwell.org/  Contact the Board for additional training providers    License  Water Well Pump Installation Contractors are licensed by the Wyoming Water Well Contractors Licensing Board.  Licenses are valid for three years and expire on December 31st.    Examination  Three separate exams are required by the Board. All exams are given at times and places determined by the Board. Contact the Board for times and locations of exams.    Fees  Application (resident). . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . . . . .$25.00  Application (nonresident) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . . . . .$100.00  License and Registration (for three years) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . . . . .  $200.00 per license area  Renewal (for three years) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $200.00 per license area  Exam fees:     Wyoming-specific exam. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 