     'AUDIOLOGIST', 'AUDIOLOGISTS  SOC Code 29-1181    Entry Salary  $30.79/hr  Average Salary  $40.35/hr    Job Description  Audiologists and speech pathologists help people with speech, language or hearing problems by examining the patient, diagnosing the disorder and providing treatment.     Requirements     1.  Submit completed application and fee     2.  Submit evidence of clinical competency by verifying current ABA certification or ASHA Certification.      Continuing Education  Twelve continuing education credit units (CEU) are required per year for license renewal.    Restrictions  Conviction of a felony.  Unprofessional conduct.  Violating any provision of the License Act for Speech Pathologists and Audiologists.     School Located in Wyoming  University of Wyoming - Laramie - College of Health Sciences - Division of Communication Disorders  http://www.uwyo.edu/comdis/    License  Audiologists must be licensed by the Wyoming Board of Speech Pathology and Audiology.   Licenses expire annually on December 31st.    Examination  No examination is required for an audiology license.    Fees  Provisional Application. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .. . $200.00  Initial License by Completing Provisional . . . . .. $100.00  Initial License. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $300.00  Endorsement. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$300.00  Annual Renewal. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  . . .$100.00    Licensing Agency  Chris Frint  Wyoming Board of Speech Pathology & Audiology  2001 Capitol Avenue, Room 127  Cheyenne, WY 82002  Phone: (307) 777-3628  Fax: (307) 777-3508  http://speech.wyo.gov/home         Additional Sources of Information  American Speech-Language-Hearing Association  2200 Research Blvd.  Rockville, MD 20850  Phone:   Members: (800) 498-2071  Non-Member: (800) 638-8255  http://www.asha.org/    American Board of Audiology  11480 Commerce Park Dr., Ste. 220  Reston, VA 20191  Phone:  (703) 790-8466  http://www.boardofaudiology.org/    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  Audiologists"   http://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/audiologists.htm    Last updated April 2023"',
