     'PHYSICIAN', 'FAMILY MEDICINE PHYSICIANS  SOC Code 29-1215    Entry Salary  $107.57/hr  Average Salary  $177.16/hr    Visit http://doe.state.wy.us/lmi/oes.htm to view wages for:  Anesthesiologists, SOC Code 29-1211  Cardiologists, SOC Code 29-1212  Emergency Medicine Physicians, SOC Code 29-1214  General Internal Medicine Physicians, SOC Code 29-1216  Neurologists, SOC Code 29-1217  Obstetricians and Gynecologists, SOC Code 29-1218  Pediatricians, General, SOC Code 29-1221  Psychiatrists, SOC Code 29-1223  Radiologists, SOC Code 29-1224  Physicians, All Other, SOC Code 29-1229  Orthopedic Surgeons except Pediatric, SOC Code 29-1242  Surgeons Except Ophthalmologists, SOC Code 29-1249    Job Description  Physicians attempt to maintain and improve the health of their patients by diagnosing medical problems and prescribing treatments.     Requirements     1. Graduate from an approved school.     2. Three (3) original references from physicians are required including at least two (2) from physicians with whom the applicant has practiced medicine within the past three (3) years.     3.  Pass an exam approved by the Board.      4  Complete a written application formulated by the Board.      5. Satisfactorily pass an interview with the Board in the case of certain circumstances.  Contact the Wyoming Board of Medicine for a list of these circumstances.     Continuing Education  In ordeer to renew a license, the licensee must have completed a minimum of sixty hours of continuing medical education (CME) during the previous three years.    Restrictions  Conviction of a felony.  Drug and/or alcohol abuse.  Dishonesty, fraud or gross negligence.  Fraud or deceit in obtaining certificate.  Manifest incapacity to practice.    School Located in Wyoming  There are no medical schools located in Wyoming; however, Wyoming residents are eligible to study out-of-state through the Western Interstate Commission for Higher Education (WICHE) or WWAMI programs.     For more information about WWAMI contact:  http://www.uwyo.edu/wwami/    For more information about WICHE, contact:  http://www.uwyo.edu/preprof/funding-your-education/wiche-wwami-wydent.html    There are two Family Practice Residency programs, affiliated with the University of Wyoming, that serve Casper, Laramie, and Cheyenne. For more information go to http://www.uwfmrpcasper.com/ (Casper),, or http://www.uwyo.edu/chyfammed/(Cheyenne).    License  Physicians must be licensed by the Board of Medicine to work in Wyoming.   Licenses expire annually on June 30th.    Examination  Interviews before the Board occur at the January, April, July, and October Board meetings.    Fees  License. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$400.00  Annual Renewal . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$155.00  First-year residency training license (T-1" license). . . . . . . . . . . .$25.00  Second-year residency training license ("T-2" license) . . . . . . . . $50.00  Residency training license ("T-2" license) renewal . . . . . . . . . . . .$50.00    Licensing Agency  Board of Medicine  130 Hobbs Avenue Ste. A  Cheyenne WY 82002  Phone: (307) 778-7053  Fax: (307) 778-2069  http://wyomedboard.wyo.gov/    Additional Sources of Information  American Medical Association  AMA Plaza  330 N. Wabash Avenue Ste 39300  Chicago IL 60611-5885  Phone: (800) 622-3211  https://www.ama-assn.org/    Association of American Medical Colleges  655 K St N.W. Ste 100  Washington DC 20001  Phone: (202) 828-0400  https://www.aamc.org/    American Medical Womens Association  1100 E. Woodfield Rd.  Suite 350  Schaumburg IL 60173  Phone: (847) 517-2801  https://www.amwa-doc.org/    Wyoming Health Resources Network  PO Box 7039  Gillette WY 82717  Phone: (307)-660-3414  http://www.whrn.org/    Wyoming Medical Society  122 E. 17th Street  Cheyenne WY 82001  Phone: (307) 635-2424  http://www.wyomed.org/    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  "Physicians and Surgeons"  http://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/physicians-and-surgeons.htm    Last updated May 2023"',
