     'FUNERAL SERVICE PROVIDERS', 'MORTICIANS, UNDERTAKERS, AND FUNERAL DIRECTORS  SOC Code 39-4031    Entry Salary  $19.52/hour  Average Salary  $25.54/hour    EMBALMERS  SOC Code 39-4011    Entry Salary  N/A  Average Salary  N/A    Requirements    1. A completed and notorized applicaton    2. Proof of legal presence in the United States.    3.  Letters of recommendation.  One letter must be from an actively licensed funeral service practitioner in good standing with the state licensing board and two must be from professional references.    4. Official college transcript    5. Official embalming or mortuary school certificate    6. Official score report from the International Conference of Funeral Service Examining Boards    7. Completed oral exam with a pass score of at least 75%.    8. Completed apprentice report stating applicant has assisted in embalming at least 25 bodies or assisted in arranging or conducting at least 25 funeral services.    9.  Verifcaton of all licenses the applicant holds or has held in the past.    Continuing Education  Licensees must complete a minimum of eight hours of continuing education each license period.    Restrictions  Conviction of a crime.  Fraud.    School Located in Wyoming  There are no mortuary science schools in Wyoming.    License  Funeral service providers must obtain their licenses from the Wyoming Board of Funeral Service Providers.  Licenses expire annually on January 1st.    Examination  For information about examinations from the International Conference of Funeral Service Examining Boards, visit https://theconferenceonline.org/    Fees  Funeral Service Practitioner License. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $125.00  Apprentice Funeral Service Practitioner License. . . . . . .. . . . . . .$75.00  Annual Non-resident Permit. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $400.00  Occasional Non-resident Permit. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$200.00  Funeral Service Provider Annual Renewal . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $125.00  Apprentice Funeral Service Provider Renewal. . . . . . . . . . . . . . .$75.00    Licensing Agency  Emma Garcia  Wyoming Board of Embalming  2001 Capitol Avenue, Room 127  Cheyennye, WY  82002  Phone: (307) 777-3503  Fax: (307) 777-3508  http://fspboard.wyo.gov/           Additional Sources of Information  Selected Independent Funeral Homes  One Overlook Point, Suite 530  Lincolnshire, IL 60069  Phone: (800) 323-4219  http://www.selectedfuneralhomes.org/    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  Funeral Service Workers"  https://www.bls.gov/ooh/personal-care-and-service/funeral-service-occupations.htm     Last Update: April 2023"',
