     'REAL ESTATE BROKER', 'REAL ESTATE BROKERS  SOC Code 41-9021    Entry Salary  N/A  Average Salary  N/A    Job Description  A Real Estate Broker sells, exchanges, purchases, rents, manages or leases real estate.     Requirements     1.  Must be of legal age.     2.  Complete and pass Broker I course.     3.  Complete and pass Broker II course.     4.  Complete and pass Wyoming Law course.      5.  Complete and pass Wyoming Broker Management course (responsible broker applicants only).     6.  Pass the national exam for brokers.     7.  Pass the state exam for brokers.     8.  Submit two fingerprint cards.    Continuing Education  Associate brokers must complete forty five hours of continuing education during each three year renewal period, including twenty one elective hours and twenty four required hours of continuing education.  Responsible Broker licensees must complete fifty three hours of continuing education during each three year renewal period, including twenty one elective hours, twenty four required hours, and eight Wyoming broker management hours. See Board website for lists of required and elective course options.       Restrictions  Conviction of a felony.  Falsifying application.  Engaging in real estate business for others without a license.  Failure to renew a license prior to expiration.  License revoked on prior occasion.  Violation of the Real Estate License Act of 1971.    School Located in Wyoming  There are several schools available throughout Wyoming. Contact the Wyoming Real Estate Commission for a complete listing.     License  Real Estate Brokers must be licensed by the Wyoming Real Estate Commission.   New licenses must be renewed by December 31st of the year they were issued.  After that, licenses expire every three years on December 31st.    Examination  The examination is computerized and is administered by Applied Measurement Professionals (AMP). Contact AMP at (913) 895-4600 or http://www.goamp.com/ for further information.    Fees  Original License.  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $300.00  Examination . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . Determined by provider  Renewal (Every Three Years) . . . . . . . . . . .$350.00    Licensing Agency  Wyoming Real Estate Commission  2617 E Lincolnway, Ste H  Cheyenne, WY 82002-0180  Phone: (307) 777-7141  Fax: (307) 777-3796  http://realestate.wyo.gov/         Additional Sources of Information  National Association of Realtors  430 N. Michigan Ave.  Chicago, IL 60611-4087  Phone: (800) 874-6500  https://www.nar.realtor/    Wyoming Association of Realtors  777 Overland Drive, Ste 220  Casper, WY 82601  Phone: (307) 237-4085  https://www.wyomingrealtors.org/    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  Real Estate Brokers and Sales Agents"  http://www.bls.gov/ooh/sales/real-estate-brokers-and-sales-agents.htm    Last updated May 2023"',
