     'REAL ESTATE SALESPERSON', 'REAL ESTATE SALES AGENTS  SOC Code 41-9022    Entry Salary  $15.60/hr  Average Salary  $36.94/hr    Job Description  Real Estate salespeople assist people in purchasing, exchanging, managing, leasing, selling, and renting real estate under the supervision of a licensed real estate Responsible Broker.    Requirements     1.  Must be of legal age.      2.  Complete and pass Salesperson I course.     3.  Complete and pass Salesperson II course.     4.  Complete and pass Wyoming Law course.     5.  Pass National Exam for salespersons.     6.  Pass State Exam for salespersons.     7.  Submit two fingerprint cards.    Continuing Education  Salesperson licensees must complete forty five hours of continuing education during each three year renewal period, which must include twenty one elective hours and twenty four required hours.  See Board website for lists of courses.    Restrictions  Conviction of a felony.  Falsifying application.  Engaging in real estate business for others without a license.  Failure to renew a license prior to expiration.  License revoked on prior occasion.  Violation of the Real Estate License Act of 1971.    School Located in Wyoming  There are several schools available throughout Wyoming. Contact the Wyoming Real Estate Commission for a complete listing.    License  Real Estate salespeople must be licensed by the Wyoming Real Estate Commission.  New licenses expire on December 31st of the  year of issue.  After that, licenses expire every three years on December 31st.    Examination  The examination is computerized and is administered by Applied Measurement Professionals (AMP). Contact AMP at (913) 895-4600 or http://www.goamp.com/Pages/default.aspx for further information.    Fees  Original License. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $300.00  Examination . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .Determined by exam provider  Renewal (Every Three Years) . . . . . . . . . . .  $350.00    Licensing Agency  Wyoming Real Estate Commission  2617 Lincolnway, Ste H  Cheyenne, WY 82002-0180  Phone: (307) 777-7141  Fax: (307) 777-3796  http://realestate.wyo.gov/        Additional Sources of Information  National Association of Realtors  430 N. Michigan Ave.  Chicago, IL 60611-4087  Phone: (800) 874-6500  https://www.nar.realtor/    Wyoming Association of Realtors  777 Overland Trail, Ste 220  Casper, WY 82601  Phone: (307) 237-4085  https://www.wyomingrealtors.org/    Occupational Outlook Handbook:  Real Estate Brokers and Sales Agents"  http://www.bls.gov/ooh/sales/real-estate-brokers-and-sales-agents.htm    Last updated May 2023"',
