     'CREMATORY OPERATOR', 'PERSONAL CARE AND SERVICE WORKERS, ALL OTHER  SOC Code 39-9098    Entry Salary  $13.49/hour  Average Salary  $15.09/hour    Job Description  Operates crematories for funeral purposes. The permittee is responsible for the maintenance, employee training, and safe operation of retort equipment used in cremation.    Requirements     1.  Be an adult.     2.  Be of good character.     3.  Be a high school graduate or have an equivalent degree.    Restrictions  Applications are reviewed by the Board.    School Located in Wyoming  No education is required.    License  Crematory Operators must be licensed by the Wyoming Board of Embalming.    Examination  None. The Board inspects crematories.    Fees  Funeral Service Practitioner License. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $125.00  Apprentice Funeral Service Pratitioner License. . . . . . . . . . . . . $75.00  Annual Non-resident Permit. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $400.00  Occasional No-nresident Permit. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $200.00  Funeral Service Provider Annual Renewal. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .  $125.00  Apprentice Funeral Service Provider Renewal . . . . . . . . . . . . . . $75.00    Licensing Agency  Emma Garcia  Wyoming Board of Embalming  2001 Capitol Avenue, Room 127  Cheyenne, WY 82002  Phone: (307) 777-5403  Fax: (307) 777-3508  http://fspboard.wyo.gov/         Additional Sources of Information  Cremation Association of North America  499 Northgate Parkway  Wheeling, IL 60090-2646  Phone: (312) 245-1077  http://www.cremationassociation.org/?page=COCP    Last updated June 2023',
