    ('72', '01', '48', '027',
     'Respiratory Care Technician', 'Must Practice in the public service for a period of one (1) year wherever the Secretary of Health determines that his services are most needed and useful, through a special authorization issued to such effects pursuant to the provisions of Act No. 79 of June 28, 1978.',
