    ('72', '01', '40', '023',
     'Nurse', 'Requires negative debt certificate of the Administration for Child Support or payment plan. Cannot have been convicted of felonies or less serious crimes involving moral depravity. http://cpepr.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Estandares-de-la-Practica-2018-FINAL-EDM.pdf',
