    ('72', '01', '6', '004',
     'Agronomists license', 'New applicants must be legal adults and citizens or legal resident alients of the United States of America. They must submit an online license application and all relevant paperwork including: a 2x2 photo taken no earlier than six months before the application date,  an original Certificate of No Penal Record issued by the Puerto Rico Police Department no more than six months prior, proof of having no outstanding childsupport debt or a payment plan for any such debt,  an original certificate from the school’s Registrar stating that the candidate has completed all the requirements conducive to a Bachelor''s Degree in Agricultural Science, a copy of the Bachelor of Science diploma in Agricultural Science issued by a university or college in Puerto Rico or the United States, and a payment of $50.',
